<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Bhal</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Bhalawi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bhalawi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bhal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bhalawi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Bhalawi nde ubhonganu wa Shelia yebhakapekiwi bhandu bha Izilaeli na Chapanga kwa kupete Musa. Shelia yenjenu ilongalela kubhokana na ntundu wa kubhoha nyambiku na nhupu. Bhelabhela shelia yenjenu ibhoha mfumu, kanuni na ntundu moipalakila kuhengakeka kwa ibada mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu. Lilobhi “Bhalawi” ngati moilembakiki mu lugha ja kutumbula ja Bhaizilaeli libhi na ndandi ja “ghaghabhahusu Bhalawi.” Bhanihabha nde bhabhakabhi bhahaghulika bhaka Chapanga bhabhakabhi na lihengu la kulongoha mahengu gha kipenganyambiku na lihengu la kujighoha Nyumba jaka Chapanga. Kulengana na majopalanelu, bhasomi bha mambu gha Bibilia bhahobhale kubha chitabu cha Bhalawi, papamu na itabu yengi ya Tolati, yani Utumbulilu, Kubhoka, Hesabu, na Kombukombu la Tolati, yakalembakiki na mlota Musa. Uchakaka aghoghu bhelabhela upwaghakika na chitabu chene, maghambu chitabu cha Bhalawi chitumbula kwa kupwagha, “Bambo Chapanga akundohiki Musa na kulonge naku mu Lihema Lihuhu.” (Sula 1:1). Bhangi bhahobhale kubha chitabu chenjenu chakalembakiki kwa kubhongana malembu ghangi gha mwande mu kaline ja 5-6 K. K. (Mangani ja Kubhelakeka Kristo), chikahi bhandu bha Izilaeli pabhakabhi kuutumwa ku Babeli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu utumbulilu wa chitabu cha Bhalawi, tusona ntundu wamaheli wa nyambiku na nhupu yaka Chapanga yeakalaghalaki ibhohakikaje na bhapenganyambiku. Nyambiku yakumu pachilanda ja yeniheyi yakabhohakiki ngati nyambiku ya kubhoha mahoku gha bhandu. Nyambiku yengi yakabhohakiki kwa upalu pela kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Kwa ntundu wokapi ghola, lakabhi lijambu lelipalika namaa kwa nyambiku jeabhoha mundu jikubhaje mu hali jinyahi nakanope, jangakubha na chilema chokapi chela. Nde chakaka kubha lijambu leniheli lakalangihi uhuhu na ukamilufu waka Chapanga. Pandu pa kujomulela pa malembu gha chitabu chenu, palandila ntundu Bhaizilaeli na bhapenganyambiku mobhakawezi kuhighalila mu uhuhu au na ntundu moibhapalaki kuhenga nahuli bhaweza kubha bhahuhu. Mada ngolongwa mu chitabu chenjenu nde kubha Chapanga nde mhuhu, na kwa kujengalela shelia yeibhi mu chitabu chenjenu, bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakabya bhaweziki kutama na Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Malaghalakilu na ntundu wa kubhoha nyambiku na nhupu patali patali, mu sula ja 1 mbaka sula ja 7.</para>
  <para style="io">Ntundu Haluni na bhana bhaki mobhakahaghuliwe na kutendakeka kubha bhapenganyambiku, mu sula ja 8 mbaka ja 10.</para>
  <para style="io">Shelia panani ja ilebhi inyahi na ihakau, na itamu patali patali, mu sula ja 11 mbaka ja 16.</para>
  <para style="io">Amuli yengi ya malaghalakilu panani ja kula, uwangalalu, lujendu lwa matamu gha bhandu, na hyaka ya Sabato, mu sula ja 17 mbaka ja 27.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s">Nyambiku ya kujochakeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />Bambo Chapanga akundohiki Musa na kulonge naku kuhuma mu Lihema Lihuhu, na kumpwaghila, <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />Ulongila na Bhaizilaeli, na kubhapwaghila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 1:2">Pachilanda jinu ngati mundu anaapala kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ja chinyama, chinyama hechi achihaghula kuhuma mulipogha laki mweni la ng'ombi, mambeleli na imbuhe. <verse eid="LEV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />Ngati nyambiku jeabhoha mundu heji nde ja kujochakeka kuhuma mu lipogha laki la ng'ombi, abhohaje ng'ombi likambaku langakubha na chilema. Aletaje pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu, nahuli ajetakaliwaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Mundu jonihoju abhekaje chiwoku chaki panani ja mmutu wa chinyama hechi cha nyambiku ja kujochakeka, na nyambiku heji anajijetakaliwaje kwa ndandi jaki, nahuli Bambo Chapanga andekakya mahoku ghaka mundu jonihoju. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Bhela, anachinjaje litoli likambaku heli palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Nabhombi bhapenganyambiku, bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Haluni, anabhatola mwahi na kumicha mu ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyamabiku, jejibhi pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Mundu hoju abhoha chingumba cha chinyama cha nyambiku ja kujochakeka na kuhekatana ipandi ipandi chinyama hechi. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Bhela, bhana bha chikambaku bhaka mpenganyambiku Haluni anabhabheka moto panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, na kujala hanju panani ja moto ghonihoghu. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Bhela bhapenganyambiku bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Haluni bhala anabhatola ipandi ya inyama jela, papamu na mmutu na mahuta, na kuibheka panani ja hanju yeibhelela panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Mundu hoju agholulaje matumbu na magholu gha chinyama hechi kwa machi. Mpenganyambiku ayonangaje nyambiku jokapi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. Jeniheji nde nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto, jejinungi wichu na kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />Ngati nyambiku jaki ja kujochakeka atola kuhuma mu lipogha laki la mambeleli au imbuhi, bhela, ahaghulaje lipongu langakubha na chilema. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Achinjaje chinyama hechi ku upambala wa kungonde wa pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nabhombi bhapenganyambiku bhabhelakeka bhaka Haluni, anabhamichaje mwahi wa chinyama hechi ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Bhela mundu hoju anahekatana ipandi ipandi, na kuibheka pakanjika mmutu papamu na mahuta ghaki, na mpenganyambiku anaibheka pamoto panani ja hanju yela yeibhelela panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Mundu hoju agholula matumbu gha chinyama hechi kwa machi. Mpenganyambiku anaijocha yokapi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. Jeniheji nde nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto, jejinungila wichu na kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />Ngati nyambiku ja kujochakeka jejibhohakeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga nde chijuni, bhela, aletaje nyambiku ja ngunda au libhunda la injebha. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Mpenganyambi anachileta chijuni hechi pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, achitunyula hingu na kunyofola mmutu wa chijuni na kuchijocha panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. Mwahi waki umichakikaje muluteta lwa pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Abhohaje chifuku cha chilebhi papamu na uchafu waki wokapi, na kuilekela upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, pandu papabhi na ilihu. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Achikamula mapapanilu na kuchighanga, nambu ngachiheketa ipandi ibheli. Bhela, mpenganyambiku anaachijochaje chijuni hechi panani ja hanju yeibhelela panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. Jeniheji nde nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto, jejinungi wichu na kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s">Nhupu ya uhembi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />Mundu jokapi anaaletiki nhupu ya uhembe kwaka Bambo Chapanga, nhupu jejiheji jibya ja uhembi laini. Ajeghala mahuta na ubani panani jaki. <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />Bhela, anaabhaletilaje bhapenganyambiku bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Haluni. Mpenganyambiku anaatola libhundi limu lelitweli uhembi ghoubhi na mahuta gha zeituni, papamu na ubani wokapi na kujocha pamoto ngati kombukombu panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. Jeniheji nde nhupu ja kujochakeka kwa moto, jejinungi wichu na kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Nyambiku ja uhembi jejihighalile nde jaka Haluni na bhana bhaki. Jeniheji nde nhupu jihuhu namaa maghambu nde pandu pa nhupu jejibhohakeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />Ngati mundu anaaletiki nhupu ja uhembi jejijochakiki pamoto, jeniheji anajikubha ja mabumunda ghangakujeghalela amila gha uhembi laini ghouhangaghinwi na mahuta gha zeituni, na mabumunda mapependau ghangakubha na amila, na jejipakakiki mahuta gha zeituni.<verse eid="LEV 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />Ngati nhupu jaku ja uhembi ujilenganaki mu chikalangilu, anajibya ja uhembi laini ghouhangaghinwi na mahuta gha zeituni, panga kubheka amila. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Mabumunda ghanihagha ughahekatanaje na kujeghe mahuta panani jaki, hajeji nde nhupu ja uhembi.<verse eid="LEV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />Ngati nhupu jaku ja uhembi jitelakiki mu sufulia, ulenganakyaje kwa uhembi laini na mahuta gha zeituni. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Uletaje nhupu heji ja uhembi jejilenganakiki kwa hindu yeniheyi kwaka Bambo Chapanga, na umpekya mpenganyambiku, jombi nde joanapelaka pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Mpenganyambiku anaatola pandu pa nhupu jeniheji jakabya nde nhupu ja kombukombu na kujijocha panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. Jeniheji nde nhupu ja kujochakeka kwa moto, jejinungi wichu na kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Nhupu ja uhembi jejihighalile nde jaka Haluni na bhana bhaki. Jeniheji nde nhupu jihuhu namaa maghambu nde pandu pa nhupu jejibhohakeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />Kila nhupu ja uhembi jeuleta kwaka Bambo Chapanga jipalika jibya jangakujeghaleka amila, kwa ndandi ngacheikupalika kujocha amila jokapi jela au busi mu nhupu jejibhohakeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Uweza kuleta kwaka Bambo Chapanga ngati nhupu ya malimbuku, nambu ngacheiweza kubhohakeka panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ngati unungilu unyahi wa kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Ujeghala mwinyo mu nhupu yaku yokapi ya uhembi. Ngawikotoka kujeghe mwinyu mu uhembi waku wa nhupu, maghambu mwinyu nde nginyulilu ja Lulaghilu loakahengiki Chapanga papamu na mwehapa, ubheka mwinyu mu nhupu yaku yokapi ya uhembi. <verse eid="LEV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />Ngati anauletiki mahunu gha kutumbula gha nhupu ya ilebhi kwaka Bambo Chapanga, wibhoha mapukutu ghaghapondakiki gha mahunu ghahenu ghaghajochakiki kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Ujeghala mahuta gha zeituni panani jaki, na ubheka ubani panani jaki, jeniheji nde nhupu ja ilebhe. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Mpenganyambiku anaajochaje pandu pa nhupu jeniheji jejipondakiki, na mahuta papamu na ubani waki wokapi, na kubha nyambiku ja kombukombu. Jeniheji anajikubha nhupu jejibhohakeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto.<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s">Nyambiku ya lukwale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />Ngati nyambiku jaka mundu nde nyambiku ja lukwale, najombi anaabhohiki ng'ombi kuhuma mu lipogha laki, analibhi likambaku au jimbomba, aletaje chinyama changakubha na chilema palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Najombi abhekaje chiwoku chaki panani ja mmutu wa chinyama chaki na kuchichinja pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu. Panihapa bhapenganyambiku bhana bhaka Haluni anabhamicha mwahi wa chinyama hechi ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Mahuta ghokapi ghaghayekalela matumbu na ghaghabhi panani ja hindu ya mkati ja chinyama hechi cha nyambiku jeniheji ja lukwale, anaaghajochaje ngati nyambiku ja kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />Figu yokapi ibheli ya chinyama hechi, papamu na mahuta ghokapi ghaghakamulini naku, ghaghabhi pambipi na chibhunu na ghala ghaghayekalela pandu panyahi pa imani, ambaghu anaaghabhoa papamu na figu. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Bhela bhana bhaka Haluni anabhaghajochaje panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, panani ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka jela jejibhi panani ja hanju yela yeibhelela, jeniheji nde nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto, unungilu unyahi wa kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />Ngati mundu anabhohiki limbeleli au imbuhi kuhuma mulipogha laki ngati nyambiku ja lukwale kwaka Bambo Chapanga, abhoha lipongu au jimbomba jangakubha na chilema. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Ngati mundu anabhohiki mwanalimbeleli, anaalileta palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />Mundu hoju bhekaje chiwoku chaki panani ja mmutu wa chinyama chaki najombi anajichinja palongi ja Lihema Lihuhu. Na bhana bhaka Haluni anabhamicha mwahi wa chinyama hechi ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Bhela, kuhuma mu nyambiku ja lukwali heji jeambokeha Bambo Chapanga kwa moto, anaambokiha hindu ayeyi: Mahuta ghaki, nkela waki ghoubhi na mahuta ghouhekitwi pambipi na chibhunu, papamu na mahuta ghokapi ghaghayekalela matumbu na ghaghayekalela hindu yengi ya mkati, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />figu ibheli, papamu na mahuta ghaghayekalela, ghaghabhi pambipi na chibhunu cha chinyama hechi, na ghala ghaghayekalela pandu panyahi pa imani, aghabhoha ghanihagha ghokapi. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Mpenganyambiku anaijocha yeniheyi yokapi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, ngati chilebhi cheabhohakewa Bambo Chapanga kwa moto.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />Ngati nyambiku jaki nde imbuhi, ajileta palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />Mundu hoju abheka chiwoku chaki panani ja mmutu wa chinyama hechi na kujichinja palongi ja Lihema Lihuhu. Bhela bhana bhaka Haluni anabhamicha mwahi wa chinyama hechi ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Bhela, kuhuma mu nyambiku jela jeabhoha, abhohaje hindu ayeyi kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto: Mahuta ghokapi ghaghayekelela matumbu, na ghaghayekalela hindu yengi yokapi ya mkati, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />na figu yokapi ibheli, papamu na mahuta ghaghabhi panani jaki pambipi na chibhunu na ghaghayekalela pandu panyahi pa imani, ghanihagha ghokapi aghabhohaje. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Mpenganyambiku anaijocha panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ngati chilebhi cha kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga kwa moto, na kubhoha unungilu unyahi kwaka Chapanga. Mahuta ghokapi nde ghaka Bambo Chapanga <verse eid="LEV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />Lilobhi aleli analikubha amuli ja kutamakila kwa ibheleku hinu yokapi, mkati ja nyumba hinu yokapi, pandu pokapi pamwitamaje, kubha ngamwikuli mahuta wala mwahi wa chinyama ng'o.<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s">Nyambiku kwa ndandi ja mahoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />Bambo akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />Ulongilaje na Bhaizilaeli, na kubhapwaghila: Ngati mundu jokapi jola anaatendiki lihoku panga kuholakela, kwa kuhenga lijambu lokapi lela lelikanakiwi mu Amuli yaka Chapanga, anaimpalika kuhenga anana:<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />Ngati mpenganyambiku joapakakiki mahuta nde joahengiki lihoku, kwa kubhatenda bhandu bhabhonikana bhatehi kuhokela, bhela jonihoju anaimpalika kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga litoli likambaku langakubha na chilema, kubha nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Aletaje litoli likambaku heli pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu, palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, najombi abhekaje chiwoku chaki panani ja mmutu wa litoli likambaku heli, na kulichinja palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Bhela mpenganyambiku hoju joajeghaliki mahuta anaatola pandu pa mwahi wa likambaku heli na kuleta mu Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Anaajwiha lukonji lwaki mu mwahi ghonihoghu na kumicha mwahi ghonihoghu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga mala saba, palongi ja lipazia leligabhanyisha Pandu Pahuhu na Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anaatola pandu pa mwahi ghonihoghu na kupaka mu manyelu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kuhukila ubani na unungilu unyahi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga mu Lihema Lihuhu. Mwahi ghouhighalila ajitala pahi ja matamilu gha pandu pa kubhoke nyambiku ya kujochakeka kwa moto jejibhi pambipi na ndyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Bhela aghabhohaje mahuta ghokapi gha ng'ombi jeniheji ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, mahuta ghaghayekalela matumbu, na ghaghayekalela hindu yengi ya mkati, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />na figu yokapi ibheli na mahuta ghaghabhi panani jaki pambipi na chibhunu, na ghala ghaghayekelela pandu panyahi pa imani, ghanihagha ghokapi aghabhohaje, <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />ngati bhela mahuta ghaghabhohakeka kuhuma mu ng'ombi jejibhohakiki nyambiku ja lukwali. Panihapa mpenganyambiku ajijochaje kwa moto panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kujochakeka. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Nambu ngozi ja lipongu leniheli na inyama jaki jokapi, papamu na mmutu na magholu ghaki, matumbu na imahi ghaki, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />yani pandu pangi pokapi papahighalile pa lipongu leniheli, aipelaka kunja la likambi mbaka pandu panyahi papajetakalewa na Chapanga, pala pabhalekela ilihu, najombi aijochaje kwa moto panani ja hanju yela yeibhi panani ja lundu lwa ilihu.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />Ngati bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli anabhahengiki lihoku panga kuholakela, kwa kuhenga lijambu lela lelikanakiwi mu Amuli jaka Bambo Chapanga, hata ngati bhandu ngachebhamanyi panani ja lijambu leniheli, bhabhi na mahakau. <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />Pabhimanyaje kubhokana na lihoku lebhahengiki, bhandu bhokapi anaibhapalika kubhoha litoli likambaku kubha nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. Ibhapalika bhaletaje litoli heli palongi ja Lihema Lihuhu laka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Bhela ihongozi bha bhandu anabhabheka mabhoku ghabhu panani ja mmutu wa likambaku leniheli lelibhi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kuchinjakika panihapa. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Bhela mpenganyambiku joajeghaliki mahuta anaaletaje mwahi wa likambaku leniheli mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Anaajwiha lukonji lwaki mu mwahi na kumicha mala saba palongi ja lipazia leligabhanisha Pandu Pahuhu na Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Bhela, pandu pa mwahi apakaje mu manyelu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nhupu ya ubani jejibhi mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Mwahi ghowihighalyaje aujitalaje pahi ja matamilu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kujochakeka jejibhi pambipi na ndyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Bhela aghatola mahuta ghokapi gha likambaku leniheli na kughajocha panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />Bhela alitendaje likambaku aleli ngati moakalitendile likambaku lengi lela la nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. Kwa kuhenga bhenibhela mpenganyambiku hoju anaabhatendila bhandu ujonganesu, nabhombi anabhalekakiwa mahoku ghabhu. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Bhela atolaje pandu pa inyama ja likambaku heli na kujipeleka kunja ja likambi, na kujijocha kwa moto ngati moakahengi kwa likambaku lengi lela. Jeniheji nde nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhokapi.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />Chikahi chiongozi anaatendiki mahoku panga kuholakela, kwa kuhenga ghaghakanakiwi mu Amuli jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waki, joakanakili mambu ghanihagha ngaghihengakeka, panihapa akubha na mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />Anaapwaghakiki lihoku leahengiki, impalika aletaje lipongu la imbuhi langakubha na chilema kubha nyambiku jaki. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Abhekaje chiwoku chaki panani ja imbuhi jeniheji, na kujichinja pandu pala ambapo nyambiku ya kujochakeka ichinjakika palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Ajeji nde nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anaatolaje pandu pa mwahi wa nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku kwa lukonji lwaki, na kumicha mu manyelu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ja nyambiku ya kujochakeka, na kujitila mwahi ghouhighalila pahi ja matamilu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Bhela mpenganyambiku aghajochaje mahuta ghokapi gha imbuhi jeniheji panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, ngati moakahengile kwa mahuta ghangi gha nyambiku ya kutama kwa lukwale. Kwa kuhenga bhenibhela mpenganyambiku anaakubha atendiki ujonganesu wa mahoku kwa ndandi jaka chiongozi jonihoju, najombi anaalekakiwa mahoku ghaki.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />Ngati mundu jokapi jola kuhuma pachilanda ja bhandu anaahengiki mahoku panga kuholakela, kwa kuhenga lijambu lelikanakiwi mu Amuli jaka Bambo Chapanga, jonihoju akubha na mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />Anaapwaghakiki mahoku ghaki ghaatendiki, impalika aletaje imbuhi jimbomba jangakubha na chilema, kubha nyambiku jaki ja kubhoha mahoku ghaatendike. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Mundu jonihoju abhekaje chiwoku chaki panani ja mmutu wa nyambiku jaki ja kubhoha mahoku, na kijichinja pandu pala pabhachinjila hinyama yengi ya nyambiku ya kujochakeka. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Bhela mpenganyambiku atolaje pandu pa mwahi wa nyambiku jeniheji kwa lukonji lwaki, na kumicha mu manyelu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kujochakeka, na kujitila mwahi ghouhighalila pahi ja matamilu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Aghabhohaje mahuta ghokapi mkati ja chinyama hechi, ngati moakabhohile mahuta kuhuma mu nyambiku ya kutama kwa lukwale, najombi mpenganyambiku aghajochaje panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku kubha unungilu unyahi wa kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga. Kwa kuhenga bhenibhela mpenganyambiku anaakubha atendiki ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaka mundu jonihoju, najombi anaalekakiwa mahoku ghaki.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />Ngati anaaletiki mwanalimbeleli kubha nyambiku jaki ja kubhoha mahoku, aletaje limbeleli limbomba langakubha na chilema. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Mundu hoju abhekaje chiwoku chaki panani jaka mwanalimbeleli heli la nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, najombi anaalichinjaje pandu pala pabhachinjila nyambiku ya kujochakeka. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Bhela mpenganyambiku atolaje pandu pa mwahi wa nyambiku jeniheji ja kubhoha mahoku kwa lukonji lwaki, na kumicha mu manyelu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kujochakeka. Mwahi ghouhighalila aujitalaje pahi ja matamilu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Aghabhohaje mahuta ghokapi mkati ja chinyama hechi, ngati moakabhokile mahuta kuhuma mu limbeleli la nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwale, na mpenganyambiku aghajochaje panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, papamu na nyambiku yeibhihakeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto. Kwa indela jeniheji mpenganyambiku anaakubha antendili ujonganesu kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghaki, najombi anaalekakiwaje mahoku ghaki.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s">Nyambiku yengi ya kubhoha mahoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />Ngati mundu jokapi jola joapalika kubhoha ulandilu pachengu kubhokana na lijambu lokapi lela lealiweni au kulijowana, najombi anaakaniki kupwagha chindu, bhela, ghonihoghu nde uhakau, jonihoju anaimpalika utemulo.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />Au ngati mundu jokapi jola pachilanda jinu anaabhi mhakau panga kuholakela kwa kukamula chindu chokapi chela chihakau, anakubhi ntuhi wa chinyama cha muchitengu chekibhi chihakau, au chinyama cha kudimakika chekibhi chihakau, au hindu yeikwabha yeibhi ihakau, jonihoju akubha na mahoku.<verse eid="LEV 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />Au mundu anaakamwi chindu chokapi chela chihakau chechibhokana na mundu, chindu chokapi chela chechiweza kuntenda mundu kubha mhakau, hata ngati akubhi ngacheamanyi, chikahi paimanyaje, anaakubha na mahoku.<verse eid="LEV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />Au ngati mundu anaalapiki kuhenga lijambu lokapi lela, lamboni au lihakau, ngati mobhahenge bhandu panga kuholalela, chikahi paimanyaje anakubha na mahoku.<verse eid="LEV 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />Bhela, chikahi mundu jokapi jola paikubha na mahoku kubhokana na lijambu lokapi lela pachilanda ja aghagha, impalika alandaje kubha kwa ntundu bholi moakahengi lihoku leniheli. <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />Mundu jonihoju impalika kundetela Bambo Chapanga limbeleli limbomba au imbuhi jimbomba, kuhuma mu lipogha laki kubha nyambiku ja kubhoha lihoku laki. Najombi mpenganyambiku anaantendila ujonganesu kwa ndandi ja lihoku laki.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />Nambu anangati mundu jonihoju ngayiwezi kumboha mwanalimbeleli, aletaje ngunda ibheli, au mabhunda ghabheli gha injebha kwaka Bambo Chapanga kubha nyambiku ja kubhoha lihoku laki leahengike: Jimu pachilanda ja hijuni yeniheyi kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, na jengi kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Ailetaje hijuni yeniheyi kwaka mpenganyambiku, najombi mpenganyambiku anaachibhoha chijuni chimu kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. Chenihechi achitunyulaje hingu jaki na kuuleka mmutu waki ujenjalaje, nambu ngaachighanga ipandi ibheli. <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />Pandu pa mwahi wa chijuni chenihechi aumichaje munkeghi ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, na mwahi ghola ghouhighalila aujitala pahi ja matamilu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. Ajeji nde nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anaachibhoha chijuni cha kabheli chela kubha nyambiku ja kujochakeka, kulengana na malaghalakilu ghaghabhekakike. Kwa kuhenga bhenibhela mpenganyambiku anaanhengila ujonganesu mundu jonihoju kubhokana na mahoku ghaahengiki, najombi mundu hoju anaalekakiwa mahoku ghaki.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />Ngati mundu jonihoju ngacheaweza kubhoha ngonda ibheli au mabhunda ghabheli gha injebha kubha nyambiku kwa ndandi ja kubhoha mahoku, bhela, aletaje uhembi ghouyaghakiki wichu kilu jimu. Nambu ngaaujeghela mahuta wala ubani panani jaki, maghambu nde nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Auletaje uhembi ghonihoghu kwaka mpenganyambiku, najombi autolaje uhembi ghonihoghu libhundi limu na kuujocha panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nhupu kubha ngati kombukombu, na kuujocha panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kujochakeka, panani ja nyambiku yeabhohakeka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto. Ajeji nde nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Bhela, mpenganyambiku anaanhengila ujonganesu mundu jonihoju kubhokana na lihoku laki, najombi mundu jonihoju anaalekakiwaje. Uhembi ghowihighalyaje anaukubha waka mpenganyambiku, ngati mokwabhelile kwa nyambiku ja uhembi.<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhupu ya kulepa fidia kwa kuhenga mahakau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa: <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />Ngati mundu jokapi jola anaahengiki lihoku panga kumanya kwa kulepa kubhoha hindu ihuhu yeipalika kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga, mundu jonihoju ipalika aletaje limbeleli likambaku langa kubha na chilema kuhuma mu lipogha laki, na lelibhi na samani ja chipemu maalumu cha pandu pahuhu. Ajeji nde nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, mundu jonihoju impalika kulepa mambu ghokapi ghaakalepalili kulepa kubhokana na hindu yeniheyi ihuhu, kwa kujonjukela pandu pa kahanu pa samani jenijela na kujibhoha jokapi kwaka mpenganyambiku. Bhela, mpenganyambiku anaanhengila ujonganesu kwa nyambiku ja limbeleli likambaku heli kwa ndandi ja kubhoha mahoku, najombi mundu hoju, anaalekakiwa mahoku ghake.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />Ngati mundu anaahengiki mahoku, kwa kuhenga lijambu lelikanakiwi ngalihengakeka mu jimu ya Amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga, hata ngati akubhi ngacheamanyi, mundu jonihoju akubha na mahoku, na impalika utemulo. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Andetilaje mpanganyambiku limbeleli likambaku langa kubha na chilema kuhuma mu lipogha laki, na lelibhi na samani jejilengana na nyambiku jela ja kubhoha mahoku. Kwa indela ajeji mpenganyambiku anaatenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaka mundu jonihoju kubhokana na lihoku leahengike panga kuholakela, najombi anaalekakiwa mahoku ghake. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Ajeji nde nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, chakaka jombi akubha abhi na mahoku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />Ngati mundu jokapi jola anaatendiki mahoku kwa kulepa kubha na ulongwana kwaka Bambo Chapanga, kwa kunkoloha njaki kubhokana na chindu cheapekiwi, au cheapekiwi kuchighoha, au anachijibhakiki, au anaambonili njaki, <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />au anaatondwili chindu chaka njaki chechahobhiki, na kupwagha kubha ngacheakiweni, au ngati anaalapiki kwa upuhe kubhokana na lihoku lokapi lela ambalu bhandu bhaweza kulihenga, <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />mundu jonihoju paakubha ahengiki lihoku leniheli na kubha na mahoku, impalika akelabhuhaje chindu chela cheajibhike, au cheachipatiki kwa kukoloha, au chindu chela cheachipatiki kwa kubhonela, au chindu chela cheapekiwi kuchighoha, au chindu chaka njaki chechakabhi chihobhiki nambu akachiwene, <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />au chindu chokapi chela cheakachilapili kwa upuhe. Impalika alepaje kila chindu ngati mochabhelile, na kujonjukela pandu pa kahanu nakanopi pa samani ja chindu chenihechi. Hindu yokapi akelabhuhaje kwaka mweni yaki mu lichobha lela paapeleka nyambiku jaki ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Bhela mundu jonihoju andetilaje mpenganyambiku limbeleli likambaku au imbuhi lipongu jangakubha na chilema na kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. Samani ja chinyama chenihechi ipalika jilenganaje na jela ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Kwa kuhenga bhenibhela mpenganyambiku anaahenga ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, najombi mundu hoju anaalekakiwaje mahakau ghokapi ghaghakuntendiki kubha na mahoku.<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyambiku ya kujochakeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />Umpekyaje Haluni na bhana bhaki malaghalakilu aghagha: Aghagha nde mambu ghaghapalika kujengalewa gha ntundu wa kubhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka: Nyambiku ja kujochakeka jihighalyaje panani ja moto ghoubhi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ikilu jokapi, mbaka lukela, nawombi moto ghonihoghu ipalika ujendalya kubhelela panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Bhela mpenganyambiku koni akabya awati ingobhu yaki inyahi ihuhu, na libundulu laki linyahi lihuhu, atolaje ilihu ya nyambiku kuhuma pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, na kuibheka punkeghi ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Bhela ahulaje ingobhu yeniheyi na kuwata ingobhu yengi, najombi atola ilihu yeniyela na kuipeleka kunja ja likambi na kughapeleka pandu panyahi papajetakaliwi na Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Moto ghoubhi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku upalika ujendalya kubhelela, ngawichuchuka ng'o. Kila lukela mpenganyambiku impalika ajonjukya hanju na kupanga nyambiku ya kujochakeka panani ja moto, na kughajocha mahuta gha nyambiku ya kutama kwa lukwali panani jaki. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Moto upalika ujendalya kubhelela chikahi chokapi panani ja pandu pa kubhoha nyambiku, panga kuchuchuka.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhupu ya uhembi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />“Yenjenu nde amuli ya nhupu ya uhembi laini. Bhana bhaka Haluni anabhailetaje palongi yaka Bambo Chapanga, na palongi ya pandu pa kubhohakela nhupu. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Jumu wa bhapenganyambiku anatola libhundi limu la uhembi laini na mahuta, papamu na ubani ghokapi ghoubhili panani ja nhupu ja uhembi, na kuijocha nhupu heji panani ja pandu pa kubhohakela nhupu ngati pandu pa ukombukelu, unungilu waki anaunyambiha Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Haluni na bhana bhaki anabhakula pandu papahighalile, nambu anabhakula panga kujeghe amila pandu pahuhu. Anabhakula paliwangala la Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Ngaijochakeki na amila ng'o, nabhapekihi ngati chibhambiku chabhu cha nyambiku jejibhohakiwi kwangu kwa moto. Nde nyambiku jihuhu namaa ngati mojibheli nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku na ja kobhoha mahakau. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Kila mwanalomi mbelekeka waka Haluni aweza kula. Nde lifungu laki la kila lichobha la nyambiku yeibhohakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto kwa ibhelekeku yeihika. Chindu chokapi chela cheanachigusaje anachikubha chaka Chapanga.” <verse eid="LEV 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />Kabheti Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />Ajeji nde nhupu ambaju Haluni na bhana bhaki ibhapalika kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga mu lichobha lela lebhahimikwa kubha bhapenganyambiku: Kilu jimu ja uhembi laini kwa lichobha, nusu jimu ja uhembi ghonihoghu anaabhoha lukela na nusu jengi anaabhoha pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Ajilenganakyaje kwa mahuta mu chikalango, ujileta jakabya jihanganginwi wichu na ubhoha nhupu heji ja uhembi jakabya jihekitwi ipandi ipande kubha unungilu unyahi wa kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Mwana waka Haluni joanajingala pandu paki ngati mpenganyambiku joajeghaliki mahuta, jonihoju nde joanaandihaje. Leniheli nde lilaghalakilu la mileli laka Bambo Chapanga, nalombi analijochakikaje nakanopi. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Kila nyambiku ja uhembi jaka mpenganyambiku anaijochakika nakanopi, ngacheipalika kula ng'o.<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyambiku kwa ndandi ja mahoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Bambo Chapanga akampwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />Umpwaghila Haluni na bhana bhaki: Aghagha nde malaghalakilu kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, pandu pala ambapu chinyama cha nyambiku ja kujochakeka pabhachinjila panihapa nde pachichinjakikaje chinyama cha nyambiku ja kubhokeha mahoku, palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, jeniheji nde nyambiku jihuhu nakanopi. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Mpenyanyambiku joabhoha nhupu jeniheji nde joanakulaje, anajikulakikaje pandu pahuhu, mu liwangala la Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Chokapi chechigusaje inyama jeniheji ja nyambiku anachikubha chihuhu na ngati mwahi wa chinyama hechi anauholulili panani ja ingobhu, ipalika ajichapilaje mu liwangala la pandu pahuhu. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Chibhegha chenabhatelakya inyama jeniheji ipalika chikajulikikaje, nambu ngati anajitelakiki mu chombu cha shaba, chombu hechi anachigholulika wichu na kujeleha kwa machi. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Kila mwanalomi mu bhandu bha munyumba jaka mpenganyambiku aweza kula inyama jeniheji, nde jihuhu nakanopi. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Nambu kila nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku ambaju mwahi waki uletakiki mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu kutenda ujonganeshu mu Pandu Pahuhu ngajikulakika ng'o, ipalalika jijochakika kwa moto.<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s">Nhupu ya kulepa fidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />Aghagha nde malaghalakilu kwa ndandi ja nhupu ja kulepa fidia, ambaju nde jihuhu nakanopi. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Chinyama cha nyambiku cha kubhoha uhakau anachichinjiwaje pandu papachinjiwa hinyama ya nyambiku ya kujochakeka, na mwahi waki upalika umichiwaji ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Mahuta ghaki ghokapi anaghabhohakika nyambiku, papamu na mahuta gha nkela na mahuta ghala ghaghayekalela hindu ya mkati, <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />na figu yokapi ibheli papamu na mahuta ghaghayongolota ghaghabhi pambipi na chibhunu na ghala ghaghayekalela pandu panyahi gha imane, ambaghu anaghabhohakika papamu na figu heyi. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Mpenganyambiku anaaghajochaje panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku kubha nyambiku jejibhohakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto. Hajeji nde nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Mwanalomi jokapi mu lukolu lwaka mpenganyambiku aweza kula, nambu ipalika jilelika pandu pahuhu, jeniheji nde jihuhu nakanope.<verse eid="LEV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />Shelia jenjenu ja kubhoha mahoku, jilengana na jela ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku: Mpenganyambiku joalongoha lihengu la ujonganeshu nde joapalika kujitola. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Mpenyanyambiku joabhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa ndandi jaka mundu jokapi jola, anatolaje chikumba cha chinyama chechibhohakiki chela kubha chake. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Kila nyambiku ja uhembi jejijochakiki pamoto au kutelakeka mu sufulia au mu chikalangu anajibya jaka mpenganyambiku joabhoha. <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />Na kila nyambiku ja uhembi, anajibhi jihangaghinwi na mahuta au nyomu, anajibya ja bhana bhaka Haluni, najombi jighabhakikaje kwa kulengana pachilanda jabhu.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhupu ya kutama kwa lukwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />Aghagha nde malaghalakilu kwa ndandi ja nhupu ja kutama kwa lukwali ambaju mundu aweza kujileta kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Anakubhi mundu abhoha nhupu heji ja kunchengu Chapanga, bhela, anaajibhohaje papamu na mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila ghaghapakiwi mahuta, mabumunda mapepandau ghaghahangaghinwi na mahuta, na mabumunda gha uhembi ghoubhi laini ghouhanganginwi na mahuta. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Papamu na nhupu jaki heji ja kutama kwa lukwali ja kunchengu Chapanga, analeta nhupu ja mabumunda ghaghalenganakiki kwa amila. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Anaaleta kila ntundu ghumu wa mabumunda ngati nhupu, nhupu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, ajeji nde jaka mpenganyambiku joamicha mwahi wa nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwale mu pandu pa kubhokeha nhupu. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Inyama ja nhupu heji ja kutama kwa lukwale kwa ndandi ja kunchengu Chapanga jilelika lichobha lelalela pajibhohakeka, ngawihighakila chindu chokapi chela mpaka lukela.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />“Nambu ngati nhupu ja lukwali heji nde ja nazili au ja kupala wamweti, anajilelakikaje lichobha lelalela pajibhohakeka na pandu pangi papahighalila jiweza kuleleka mu lichobha la kabheli lake. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Inyama jokapi ja nyambiku jejihighalila mpaka lichobha la katatu ipalika jijochakikaje kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Ngati pandu pa inyama ja nyambiku ja lukwale anajikulakiki lichobha la katatu, Bambo Chapanga ngaajijetekeli. Ngajijetakalewi kwaka jombi joabhohike, kwa ndandi nde jihakau, mundu joaikulaje pandu pa nyambiku jeniheji aibya na utemulo kwa lihakau leniheli. <verse eid="LEV 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />Inyama jokapi jejigusiki chindu chihakau ngaikula mundu. Inyama jeniheji anajijochakika kwa moto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 7:19">“Bhandu bhokapi bhabhajetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga bhaweza kula inyama jeniheji. <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />Nambu ngati mundu jokapi nde muhakau anakuliki inyama jokapi jela ja nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwale jejibhohakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, mundu jonihoju anaatengakika kutali na bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Mundu jokapi joagusa chindu chokapi chechibhi chihakau, au chindu chihakau chaka mundu, au chinyama chechibhi chihakau, au chindu chokapi chihakau ambacho nde uhakalilu, anakuliki inyama ja nyambiku ja lukwali jeabhohakiwi Bambo Chapanga, mundu jonihoju anaatengakika kutali na bhandu bhaki.”<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />“Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli: Ngamwikula mahuta gha ng'ombi, au gha limbeleli au gha imbuhe. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Mahuta gha chinyama chokapi chechiwi cheni au ja chinyama chechikomakiki na chinyama cha muchitengu muweza kughabheka kwa kuhengela lihengu lengi, nambu ngamwikula ng'o. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Mundu jokapi anakuliki mahuta gha chinyama chechibhohakiki nyambiku kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa kujochakeka kwa moto, anaatengakika kutali na bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Kabhete, ngamwikula mwahi wokapi ghola, ukubhi wa chijuni au wa chinyama pandu pokapi pamtama. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Mundu jokapi anakuliki mwahi wokapi ghola, anaatengakika kutali na bhandu bhaki.”<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />“Ubhapwaghila bhandu Bhaizilaeli anana: Mundu jokapi anabhoiki nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwale, anaampekya Bambo Chapanga pandu pa nyambiku heji. <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Aletaje nyambiku jeniheji ja kujochakeka kwa moto kwa mabhoku ghaki mweni kwa Bambo Chapanga, analeta mahuta gha chinyama hechi papamu na chihimba, najombi anachijinua chihimba hechi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kubha nyambiku ja kujinuliwa. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Mpenganyambiku anaaghayonanga mahuta ghokapi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, nambu chihimba anachibya chaka Haluni na bhana bhaki bhapenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Chigholu cha kumalelelu cha kunyuma cha chinyama cha nyambiku hinu ya kutama kwa lukwale anamumpekyaje mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />Chigholu hechi anachikubhaje chaka mpenganyambiku joabhili mbelakeka waka Haluni joabhoha mwahi wa nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwali, na mahuta ghaki. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Kuhuma mu nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwali ya Bhaizilaeli, nepani Chapanga nyopalili chihimba chela chechajinuliwi papamu na chigholu chela cha chinyama chechabhohakiki, nanatu mohiki kwaka mpenganyambiku Haluni na bhana bhake kubha lifungu labhu la mileli kuhuma kwa Bhaizilaeli.” <verse eid="LEV 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Panihapa nde pandu papabhohakiki kwa ndandi jaka Aloni na bhana bhake kuhuma mu nyambiku yehabhohakewa Bambo Chapanga kwa moto, kutumbula lichobha lebhahimikwi kubha bhapenganyambiku bhaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Lichobha lela lebhajeghaliki mahuta, Bambo Chapanga akalaghalakili kubha Bhaizilaeli bhabhapekya haleli ngati lifungu labhu la mileli kwa ibhelekeku yeihika.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Bhela, ghanihagha nde malaghalakilu kubhokana na nyambiku ja kujochakeka, nyambiku ya uhembi, nyambiku ya kubhoha mahoku, nyambiku ya kubhoha mahakau na kubhokana na nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwali, <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />ambayu Bambo Chapanga akumpeki Musa panani ja chitombi cha Sinai mu lichobha lela paabhalaghalakile Bhaizilaeli bhaleta nyambiku yabhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, ku lipololu la Sinai hoku.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s">Kuhimikwa kwaka Haluni na bhana bhaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 29:1-37">Kubhoka 29:1-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“Undetila Haluni na bhana bhaki ingobhu yabho, mahuta gha kupaka, ng'ombi likambaku kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja mahoku, mambeleli makambaku ghabheli na chitonga chechibhi na mabumunda ghaghalenganakiwi panga na amila. <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />Bhela ubhabhongana bhandu bhokape bhabhabhile pa ndyangu wa kujingalila pa Lihema Lihuhu.” <verse eid="LEV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Musa akatendiki ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili, lipogha la bhandu lakabhonganiki papamu pu ndyangu wa kujingalila mu Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Musa akalipwaghi lipogha, “Haleli nde Bambo Chapanga leakalaghalaki litendakikaje.”<verse eid="LEV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Bhela Musa akundetiki Haluni na bhana bhaki palongi, na kubhagholola kwa machi ngati mowabheli ntetu wabhu. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Bhela Haluni akawatikwi likanzu na kulikonga kwa ulamba, akunhwatiki lijoho, na chizibau na kuchikonga kwa ulamba ghoulenganakiki wichu namaa mu chibhunu chaki. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Akumbekiki chifuku panani ja pachihimba chaka Haluni na mkati ja chifuku hechi akabhekiki maganga ghabheli gha Ulimu na Tumimu gha kulaluki ghala ghaaghapala Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Kabheti Haluni akawatikwi mbumbu mmutu wake, na panani ja mbumbu, upambala wa palongi akabhekiki lilobha la zahabu lela, na litaji lihuhu lela, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Bhela Musa akatoliki mahuta gha kupaka na kulipaka Lihema na kila chindu chechakabhi mkati jaki, bhela akaibhekiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Akamichiki mahuta ghakumu panani ja pandu pakubhokeha nyambiku mala saba, akapakihi mahuta pandu pakubhokeha nyambiku na yombu yaki yokapi papamu na liteleku na chitamilu chaki, nahuli kuibheka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Akunjitalili mahuta ghakumu hagha panani ja mmutu waka Haluni, nahuli kumbeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Bhela Musa akabhaletiki bhana bhaka Haluni, na kubhawatika likanzu na kubhakonga ulamba na kubhawatika mbumbu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Bhela Musa akaletiki ng'ombi likambaku ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, najombi Haluni na bhana bhaki bhakabhekiki mabhoku ghabhu panani ja mmutu wa ng'ombi heji. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Musa akachinjiki ng'ombi heji, akatoliki mwahi akaupakiti mu manyelu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ipambala yokapi kwa lukonji lwaki nahuli kupagholola. Bhela akatoliki mwahi ghoukahighalili akaujitili pahi ja pandu pa kubhohakeha nyambiku ambaju akaibhekiki palongi yaka Bambo Chapanga nahuli kutenda ujonganeshu kwa ndandi jaki. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Bhela Musa akatoliki mahuta ghokapi ghaghayongolota pandu pokapi pa mkati, mahuta ghaghayekalela imani, figu yokapi ibheli, na mahuta ghaki na kughajocha panani ja pandu pa kubhohakeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Nambu inyama ja ng'ombi heji, chingumba chaki na imahi ghaki, akaijochiki kwa moto kunja ja likambi, ngati moakalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Bhela Musa akandetili limbeleli likambaku kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka, Haluni na bhana bhake bhakabhekiki mabhoku ghabho panani ja mmutu wa limbeleli heli. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Musa akalichinjiki na mwahi wa limbeleli heli akaumichiki mu ipambala yokapi ya pandu pokapi pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Akalihekiti limbeleli heli ipandi ipandi, na akaijochiki papamu na mmutu waki na mahuta ghaki. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Bhela paakagholwi matumbu na magholu kwa machi, Musa akaijochiki yokapi heyi panani ja pandu pakubhokela nyambiku papamu na hindu yengi ya limbeleli heli ngati nyambiku ja kujochakeka. Jeniheji nde nyambiku jejibhohakeka kwa moto, jejibhi na unungilu wa kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga. Musa akatendiki ngati moakalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Bhela akaliletiki limbeleli likambaku lengi, kwa ndandi ja kubhahimika kubha bhapenganyambiku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Haluni na bhana bhaki bhakabhekiki mabhoku ghabhu panani ja mmutu wa limbeleli heli. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Musa akalichinjiki limbeleli likambaku lela na kutola pandu pa mwahi wa limbeleli lela na kupaka panani ja likutu la kumalelelu laka Haluni na panani ja lukonji lukolongwa lwa chibhoku cha kumalelelu, na panani ja lukonji lukolongwa lwa chigholu cha kumalelelu. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Bhana bhaka Haluni nabhombi bhakahikiki, najombi Musa akabhapakiki mwahi uchokopi panani ja makutu ghabhu gha kumalelelu, ngonji ikolongwa ya mu mabhoku ghabhu gha kumalelelu na mu ngonji ikolongwa ya magholu ghabhu gha kumalelelu. Mwahi ghowahighalili akaumichili mu ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Akatoliki mahuta gha chinyama, mahuta gha nkela, mahuta ghokapi ghaghayongolota pandu pa mkati, mahuta ghaghahyekalela pandu panyahi pa imani, figu yokapi ibheli, papamu na mahuta ghaki na lipaja la chigholu cha kunyuma cha kumalelelu cha limbelei likambaku heli. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Bhela, kuhuma mu chitonga cha mabumunda ghaghalenganakiwi panga amila, chechakabhi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, akatoliki libumunda limu, na lengi lelakalenganakiwi kwa mahuta gha zeituni, na libumunda lipepandau, akaibhekiti yokapi panani ja mahuta gha zeituni, na panani ja lipaja la chigholu cha kumalelelu la kunyuma. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Akaibhekiki yokapi heyi mu mabhoku ghaka Haluni na bhana bhake, na kuikweha palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kubha nyambiku ja kujinuliwa. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Bhela Musa akaitoliki hindu yokapi heyi kuhuma mu mabhoku ghabhu na kuijocha panani ja pandu pa kubhohakea nyambiku papamu na nyambiku ja kujochakeka. Hajeji nde nyambiku ja kubhekakeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nde nyambiku jejibhowakeka kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Bhela Musa akatoliki chihimba chela, na kutenda nginyulila ja kumbokela Bambo Chapanga. Pandu pa limbeleli likambaku lela la kujinuliwa palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga nde lelakabhi laka Musa ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Bhela Musa akatoliki mahuta gha kupaka na mwahi kuhuma pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, akummichili Haluni na ingobhu yaki. Bhela Musa akumbekiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga Haluni na bhana bhaki papamu na ingobhu yabhu.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Bhela Musa akumpwaghili Haluni na bhana bhaki, “Telaka inyama heji pu ndyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu na ukulaje panihapa papamu na libumunda kuhuma mu chitonga cha nyambiku ja kubhekakeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, ngati monaghalakile, ‘Haluni na bhana bhaki anabhakulaje.’ <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Bhela ujochaje inyama na mabumunda ghaghahighalile. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Ngamwibhoka pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu kwa machobha saba, mbaka lichobha linu la kubhekakeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga palikubha lihikiki, kwa ndandi chikahi chinu cha kubhekakeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga anachibya machobha saba. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Lela lelitendakiki lalenu lakalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga nahuli kutenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi jinu. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Impalika mtama pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu ikilu na muhi kwa machobha saba, na kutenda lela Bambo Chapanga lealipala, nahuli ngamwipotela, kwa kubha leniheli nde lenaghalakiwi.” <verse eid="LEV 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Bhela, Haluni na bhana bhake bhakahengiki mambu ghanihagha ghokapi ghabhalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga kwa indela jaka Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s">Bhapenganyambiku bhatumbu lihengu labhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Bhela mu lichobha la nane Musa akundohiki Haluni na bhana bhaki na ihongozi bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Musa akumpwaghi Haluni, “Utola litoli likambaku kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku na limbeleli likambaku kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka, hinyama yokapi ngaikubha na chilema. Bhela bhabhoha nyambiku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli bhatola lipongu la limu la imbuhi kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, na litoli limu na mwanalimbeleli limu ghokapi gha chaka chimu na ghangakubha na chilema kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka, <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />na ng'ombi jimu jikambaku na limbeleli limu likambaku kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwale, bhakumbokiha Bambo Chapanga papamu na nyambiku ya uhembi jejihanganginwi na mahuta gha zeituni maghambu lalenu Bambo Chapanga anaabhapitalyaje.”<verse eid="LEV 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Bhaizilaeli bhakaletiki hindu yokapi heyi palongi ja Lihema Lihuhu ngati Musa moakabhalaghalakile, na lipogha lokapi lakaheghalili na kujema palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Panihapa Musa akapwaghike, “Haleli nde Bambo Chapanga lealaghalakili mulitendaje, nahuli ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga upata kubhonikana kwinu.”<verse eid="LEV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Musa akumpwaghi Haluni, “Ujendaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku nahuli ubhoha nyambiku jaku ja kubhoha mahoku na nyambiku jaku ja kujochakeka, utendaje ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaku wamweti na kwa ndandi ja bhandu, ngati bhela Bambo Chapanga moalaghalakile.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Bhela, Haluni akaheghalili pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, akalichinjiki litoli lela leakalibhohiki libya nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku ghaki mweni Haluni. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Bhela bhana bhaka Haluni bhakundetili Haluni mwahi ghola, najombi akajwihiki lukonji lwaki mu mwahi hoghu na kupaka mu manyelu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, mwahi ghoukahighalili akaujitili pahi ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Bhela mahuta na figu akaijochiki yokapi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Nambu inyama na chingumba akaijochiki pa moto kunja ja likambi.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Bhela Haluni akachinjiki chinyama cha nyambiku ja kujochakeka. Bhana bhaki bhakundetili mwahi, najombi akaumichiki mu ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Bhela bhakundetili nyambiku ja kujochakeka, chipandi chimu chimu, na mmutu, najombi akaijochiki panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Akagholwili matumbu na magholu, na kuijocha papamu na nyambiku jela ja kujochakeka jejibhi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Bhela, Haluni akajiletiki nyambiku jela jejabhili kwa ndandi ja bhandu. Akajitoliki imbuhi jela ja nyambiku ja mahoku kwa ndandi ja bhandu, akajichinjiki na kujibhoha nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku kwa ndandi ja bhandu, ngati moakatendi kwa imbuhi jela ja kutumbula. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Haluni akaletiki nyambiku ja kujochakeka, na kujibhoha ngati moakalaghalakiwi. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Bhela akaletiki nhupu ja uhembi, akatoliki libhundi limu na kulijocha panani ja pandu pakubhokeha nyambiku papamu na nyambiku ja kujochakeka ja lukela.<verse eid="LEV 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Akachinjiki ng'ombi likambaku na limbeleli likambaku la nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwali kwa ndandi ja bhandu. Bhana bhaki bhakumpekihi mwahi ghola, najombi akaumichiki mu ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Nambu pandu pala pa mahuta gha likambaku lela na limbeleli likambaku lela, mahuta gha nkela, mahuta ghaghayekalili matumbu, figu yaki, na ghaghayekalili pandu panyahi pa imani, <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />hayeyi yokapi bhakaibhekiki panani ja ihimba, bhela Haluni akaghajojichi mahuta gha hinyama panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Nambu Haluni akajinwi ihimba yela na lipaja la kunyuma la kumalelelu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kubha nyambiku ja kujinuliwa, ngati Musa moakalaghalakile.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Bhela Haluni paakajomwi kubhoha nyambiku yokapi, nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, nyambiku ja kujochakeka na nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwali, akabhajinulili bhandu mabhoku, akabhapengalili, na kuhuluka pahi. <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Bhela Musa na Haluni bhakajingili mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu. Pabhakapitiki kunja bhakabhapengalili bhandu, nawombi ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga ukabhapitalili bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Moto ukahikiki kuhuma mu ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga, ukajochiki nyambiku jela ja kujochakeka, papamu na pandu pa mahuta ghaghakabhi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. Bhandu bhokapi pabhakaweni lijambu heli, bhakajamalili kwa chiheku na kuchikama ukutama mbaka pahi.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s">Lihoku laka Nadabu na Abihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Nadabu na Abihu bhana bhaka Haluni bhakatoliki chetezu yabhu, bhakabhekiki moto mkati jaki na kujonjukela ubani, bhela bhakumbokili Bambo Chapanga moto wanga kupalika, ghoubhili chihanganyuma na malaghalakilu ghaka Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Bhela moto ukapitalili palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kubhayonanga akakombu bhala, nabhombi bhakapotili palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Bhela Musa akumpwaghi Haluni, “Haleli nde lela leapwaghiki Bambo Chapanga chikahi paakapwaghike, ‘Pachilanda ja bhala bhabhanheghalela ananililangihaje kubha mhuhu, pamihu ja bhandu bhokapi anandopalikaje.’ ” Haluni akatumbili chinunu.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Bhela, Musa akabhalohiki Mishaeli na Elisafani, bhana bhaka Uzieli, tati nchoku waka Haluni, na kubhapwaghila, “Muhika pambane, mujibhoha mituhi ja bhalongu bhinu kunja ja likambi kutali na Pandu Pahuhu.” <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Bhela bhakahikiki na kubhoha mituhi, bhakabya bhahwati ingobhu yabhu ya ibada, bhakabhapeliki kunja ja likambi, ngati Musa moakabhalaghalakile.<verse eid="LEV 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Bhela Musa akumpwaghi Haluni papamu na bhana bhaki, Eleazali na Itamali, “Ngamwiyekula mayunju gha mimutu jinu wala ngamwikachula ingobhu hinu, anangati ngabhela anampotilaje na Bambo Chapanga anaabhayomila bhandu bhokapi. Nambu bhalongu bhinu, nyumba jokapi ja Izilaeli anabhaweza kubhalelela bhala ambabhu Bambo Chapanga abhayoningi kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Ngamwipita kunja ja ndyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu nangabhela anampotilaje, kwa ndandi mahuta gha kupaka ghaka Bambo Chapanga ghakali ghabhi panani jinu.” Bhela bhakatendiki ngati Musa moakapwaghile.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu kwa bhapenganyambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Haluni, <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Wehapa na bhana bhaku ngamwikunywa divai wala chakunywa chengi chokapi chechibhi na amila chikahi pampala kujenda kujingila mu Lihema Lihuhu, nangabhela anampotilaje. Hajeji anajikubha amuli ja mileli mu ibheleku hinu yokapi. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Impalika muhaghulaje pachilanda ja mambu mahuhu na mambu ghangakubha mahuhu, pachilanda ya mambu mahakau na ghangakubha mahakau. <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />Impalika mwabhola Bhaizilaeli shelia yokapi ambayu Bambo Chapanga akumpekihi kwa kupete Musa.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Bhela Musa akabhapwaghi Haluni papamu na bhana bhaki bhabhahighalile, Eleazali na Itamali, “Mtolaje pandu pa nyambiku ja uhembi jejihighalile kuhuma mu nyambiku yeabhohakewa Bambo Chapanga kwa moto, mkulaje pambipi na pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku panga kujeghe amila kwa ndandi nde jihuhu namaa. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Anamjikula mu pandu pahuhu kwa ndandi nde lifungu linu na lifungu la bhana bhinu la nyambiku jejibhohakiki kwa Bambo Chapanga kwa moto, ndandi bhenibhela nde monaghalakiwi. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Nambu wehapa na bhana bhaku na akakamwali bhaku muweza kula chihimba chela chechajinuliwi na lipaja lela lelabhohakiki. Anamkula pandu panyahi pa kawaida ja ibada, upekiwi wehapa na bhana bhaku kubha lifungu linu la nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwali la Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Lipaja lela lelabhohakiki na chihimba chela chechijinuliwi ipalika iletakikaje papamu na pandu pa mahuta gha nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto, nahuli kujinuliwa palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga ngati nyambiku ja kujinuliwa. Haleli analikubha lifungu laku la mileli na bhana bhaku, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakalaghalakile.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Musa paalalukili kubhokana na imbuhi jejibhohakeka kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja mahoku, na kubhona kubha jiyonangike, akabhayomili Eleazeli na Itamali, bhana bhaka Haluni bhabhahighalile, na kubhalalukila, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Bho, maghambu kike ngachemwakuliki nyambiku ja mahoku pachilanda ja pandu pahuhu? Kwa kubha nde jihuhu namaa, mkapekiwi mwanganya nahuli kubhoha mahoku gha lipogha, kwa ndandi ja kutenda ujonganesu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Kwa kubha mwahi waki ngachewaletakiki mkati ja Pandu Pahuhu, mkabya mkulike imbuhi heji mkati ja Pandu Pahuhu ngati monalaghalakile.”<verse eid="LEV 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Haluni akamuyangiki Musa, “Lalenu bhana bhangu bhabhohiki nyambiku yabhu ya kubhoha mahoku na nyambiku yabhu ya kujochakeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nambu mambu ngati aghagha ghambatiki nepani. Bho, Bambo Chapanga akabya anyambakiki lelu ngati nakabi nguliki nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku lalenu?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Musa paakajowini ghanihagha, akakotwiki kuyoma.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s">Hinyama ihakau na yangakubha ihakau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 14:3-21">Kombukombu la Tolati 14:3-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />Bambo Chapanga akabhapwaghi Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />Mubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli: Pachilanda ja hinyama yokapi yeitama panani ja ndema, ayeyi nde yeanamkulaje: <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />Muweza kula chinyama chokapi chechibhi na mangolokotu ghaghakajwiki pandu pabheli na chekibokola.<verse eid="LEV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />Kubhi na hinyama yengi ambayu ibokola pela au yeibhi na mangolokotu ghaghakajwiki pela, nambu yeniheyi ngamwikula ng'o. Ngamia, papamu na kubha atenda kubokola nambu ngachejibhi na mangolokotu ghaghakajwike, kwa ntetu wa kujojabhela chinyama chenihechi nde chihakau kwinu. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Chibhela, papamu na kubha chitenda kubokola, nambu ngachechibhi na mangolokotu ghaghakajwike, chinyama chenihechi che chihakau kwinu. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Chipecha, papamu na kubha chitenda kubokola, nambu ngachechibhi na mangolokotu ghaghakajwike, chinyama chenihechi nde chihakau kwinu. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Nalombi ligholobhi papamu na kubha libhi na mangolokotu ghaghakajwiki pandu pabheli, nambu ngachelibokola, leniheli nde likahau kwinu. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Ngamwikula hinyama yeniyehi wala kukamula mituhi jabhu, yeniheyi nde ihakau kwinu.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />Homba yokapi yeibhi mu bahali au mu nkoka yeibhi na mapezi na mang'amba, muweza kula. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Nambu chokapi chechitama mu bahali au mu mikoka, ambachu ngachekibhi na mapezi na mang'amba, yani hiumbi yokapi yeijenda mumachi na hiumbi yengi yokapi yeitama mumachi, yeniheyi nde ihakau kwinu. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Nayombi anaikubha mahakalilu kwinu. Ngamwikula inyama yabhu, najombi mituhi jabhu anajikubha mahakalilu kwinu. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Chokapi chechitama mkati ja machi ambachu ngachekibhi na mapezi na mang'amba anachibya mahakalilu kwinu.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />Hijuni yenjenu yokapi nde ihakau kwinu, bhela ngamwikula: Ngwahe, chijuni chechilowakeka fulukombe, kapongu, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />limbanga, na chijuni chechilowakeka kozi kwa ntundu waki, <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />ntundu wokapi wa makongolu, <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />mbuni, kihomba ndela, litipitipi, chununkwangula, na ntundu wokapi wa mambanga, <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />litungutu, mnandi, linhinhita, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />mumbi, mwali, mdeli, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />kolongo, na ntundu ghokapi wa koikoi, hudihudi na malemalema.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />Hidudu yokapi yeibhi na mapapanila na yeijenda kwa magholu ghaki nchechi, yeniheyi nde ihakalilu kwinu. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Nambu, ibhi hidudu yeibhi na mapapanila ambayu ijenda kwa magholu nchechi yemuweza kula: Yela yeibhi na mahundwa mu magholu ghaki malachu na kuhomba homba panani ja inchi. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Pachilanda ja yeniheyi, anankula nzige kwa ntundu wokapi, senene kwa ntundu waki, mapahi kwa ntundu waki au palale kwa ntundu waki. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Nambu hidudu yengi yokapi yeibhi na mapapanila na yeibhi na magholu nchechi nde mahakalilu kwinu.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />Mwehapa anamkubha bhahakau kwa hinyama yeniheyi, kila joanakamulaje mituhi jabhu anaakubha muhakau mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Mundu jokapi joanatotula mituhi ja hiumbi yeniheyi, impalika achapaje ingobhu yaki, najombi anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Mundu jokapi anaakamwili chinyama chechibhi na lingolokotu lelikajwiki pabheli nambu ngachechibokola, mundu hoju anaakubha mhakau. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Pachilanda ja hinyama yokapi yeijenda kwa magholu nchechi, yela yeijenda kwa highanja yabhu nde ihakau kwinu, mundu jokapi joanakamulaje mituhi jabhu anaakubha mhakau mpaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Mundu jokapi joanatotulaje mituhi jabhu, impalika achapa ingobhu yaki, najombi anakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. Hinyama yeniheyi nde ihakau kwinu.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />Kubhokana na hinyama yeikwabha panani ja inchi, ayeyi nde ihakau kwinu: chindindi, likuli, na ntundu wokapi wa manjocholi kwa ntundu waki, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />chinyama chechilowakeka gulugulu, lighondwa, manjocholi gha mulumatu, chinyama chechilowakeka golomoe na lwiha. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Yeniheyi yokapi yeikwabha panani ja inchi nde ihakau kwinu. Jokapi joanakamulaje mituhi jabhu anaakubha mhakau mpaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Anakubhi chimu cha chinyama anachiwile na kuhabhukila panani ja chindu chokapi chela, chombu hechi, hata ngati cha kuhengela lihengu lokapi lela, anachibya chihakau, hata ngati chilenganakiki kwa mikongu, ingobhu, chingumba au ligunila. Chibhekakikaje mkati ja machi, anachikubha chihakau mpaka pakamihe, bhela anachikubha chinyahi kabhete. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Anakubhi jumu wa chinyama chechiwili anachihabhukili mkati ja chipika, kila chekibhi mkati ja chipika hechi anachibya chihakau, na wehapa ikupalika ukajulaje chipika chenihechi. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Chilebhi chokapi ambachu chechiwezikana kula nambu anakubhili chijingili machi kuhuma mu chipika hechi nde chihakau, na chindu chokapi cha machi machi ambachu chiweza kunyweleka kuhuma mu chipika hechi nde chihakau. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Kila chindu ambachu pandu pa ntuhi utehi kuchihabhukila, anachikubha chihakau. Anakubhi chihinja au chipika cha kutelakela ipalika chikajulikaje. Nde chihakau, na wehapa ipalika umanya kubha nde chihakau. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Nambu chemichemi ya machi au chilibha, pandu pa kuteka machi, anapakubha panyahi, nambu chokapi chechigusaje chimu cha mituhi jeniheji anachikubha chihakau. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Ngati ntuhi anauhawiki panani ja imbeju jokapi jela ambaju nde ja kupanda, anajihighalya kubha jinyahi. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Nambu ngati imbeju jijeghaliki machi na ntuhi anauhawiki panani jaki, imbeju heji nde jihakau kwinu.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />Ngati chinyama ambachu njetakaliwi kula anachihwili, jokapi joanagusa ntuhi waki, anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />“Mundu jokapi anaakuliki inyama ja ntuhi hoghu anachapa ingobhu jaki na anakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. Na jokapi joanatotula ntuhi hoghu, anachapa ingobhu yaki, najombi anakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />“Kila chiumbi chechikwabha panani ja inchi nde lihakalilu, ngamwikula. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Ngamwikula chiumbi chokapi chela chechikwabha panani ja luhombi, chikubhi chechikwabha kwa lutumbu lwaki au chechikwabha kwa magholu nchechi au kwa magholu ghamaheli, nde lihakalilu. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Ngamwalijeghe uhakau kwa chokapi mu hiumbi ayeyi. Ngamwalijeghe uhakau kwa hiumbi heyi na bhela mwehapa mabheni kujeghaleka uhakau. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, muligholulaje mkubha bhahuhu, kwa ndandi nepani nde mhuhu. Ngamwalijeghe uhakau mabhete kwa chiumbi chokapi chela chechijenda panani ja inchi. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga nenunkwehiki mboka ku inchi ja Misili nahuli mya Chapanga winu, bhela mkubha bhahuhu kwa ndandi nepani nde mhuhu.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />“Aghagha nde malaghalakilu kubhokana na hinyama, ijuni, kila chiumbi chomi chechijenda mkati ja machi na kila chiumbi chechijenda panani ja inchi. <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />Impalika mumanyaje pachilanda ja chinyama chechibhi chihakau na chechibhi chinyahi, na pachilanda ja hiumbi yomi yemuweza kula na yangakupalika kula.”<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s">Kubhagholola akambomba baada ja kulibhopola bhana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />“Ubhapwaghilaje bhandu bha Izilaeli: ‘Mbomba ambaju anapata chitumbu na kulibhopo mwana wa chikambaku anakubha mhakau kwa ntetu wa kujojabhela kwa machobha saba, ngati moabhelela mhakau chikahi cha machobha ghaki gha ntetu wa akambomba. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Mwana wa chikambaku hoju anahekata jandu mu lichobha la nane. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Bhela mabhu waka mwana hoju anajendalya kubha mhakau kwa machobha selasini na ghatatu. Chikahi hechi, ngaikamu chindu chokapi chela chechibhekakiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, wala kujingila Pandu Pahuhu mbaka lichobha la kugholuleka kwaki palihikaje. <verse eid="LEV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Ngati anaalibhopwi mwana wa chimbomba, mbomba hoju anaakubha mhakau kwa majuma ghabheli, ngati moabhelela mhakau chikahi cha machobha ghaki gha ntetu wa akambomba. Bhela anaalendalyaje kwa machobha sitini na sita panihapa nde anagholulikaje.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />“ ‘Machobha ghaki gha kugholuleka, ikubhi ampatiki mwana wa chikambaku au kamwali, paghikamilikaje, mbomba hoju andetila mpenganyambiku pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu mwanalimbeleli la chaka chimu kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka na likenda la injebha au ngunda kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Anaibhoha palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga nahuli kutenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaki, na kabheti anaakubha wichu kwa ntetu wa kujojabhela kuhuma mu mwahi waki. Aghagha nde malaghalakilu kwa ndandi jaka mbomba joanabhelaka mwana wa chikambaku au wa chimbomba. <verse eid="LEV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />Ngati mbomba hoju ngachebhi na uwezu wa kumpata mwanalimbeleli, anaaleta ngunda au makenda ghabheli gha injebha, jimu kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka na jengi kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja mahoku. Kwa indela hajeji, mpenganyambiku anaatenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaki, najombi anakubha wicho.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s">Shelia kubhokana na itamu ya ngozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />Bambo Chapanga akabhapwaghi Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“Anakubhi mundu jokapi jola anachunhimbiki chindu au ikwanda au alama jihuhu panani ja ngozi jaki ambaju jiweza kubha chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila, ipalika aletakikaje kwaka Haluni mpenganyambiku au kwaka jumu wa bhana bhaki, joabhi bhapenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Mpenganyambiku analingalya chinyuli hechi chechibhi panani ja ngozi jaka mundu hoju na ngati majunju gha pandu papabhi na chinyuli ghang'anambwiki kubha mahuhu, na anachibhi chinyuli chijingili mkati ja ngozi, bhela nde chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila, yani malohi. Chikahi mpenganyambiku anaandingalili, anaantangaza mundu hoju kubha nde mhakau kwa ntetu wa kujojabhela. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Ngati chinyuli panani ja ngozi jaki nde chihuhu nambu ngachechibhonakini chijingi mkati nakanopi ja ngozi na majunju mu alama heji ngachejing'anambwiki kubha jihuhu, mpenganyambiku anaantenga mundu jonihoju pandu pakanjika kwa machobha saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Lichobha la saba, mpenganyambiku anaandinga na ngati ngaibhoni ling'anambuku pa chinyuli chela na ngachechijaghanili panani ja ngozi, anaamtenga kwa machobha ghangi saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Lichobha la saba mpenganyambiku anaandingalya kabheti, na ngati libaka liwiniki na ngachelijaghanili panani ja ngozi, mpenganyambiku anaantangaza mundu jonihoju kubha mnyahi, nde ikwanda pena. Impalika mundu hoju achapaje ingobhu yaki, najombi anakubha wichu. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Nambu anakubhi chinyuli chela anachijaghani panani ja ngozi jaki paakajomwili kulilangiha kwaka mpenganyambiku na kutangazwa kubha abhi wichu, impalika ajendaje kabheti kwaka mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Mpenganyambiku anaandinga na ngati ikwanda ijaghanili mu ngozi, anaantangaza kubha nde mhakau, nde chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila, yani malohi.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />“Ngati mundu jokapi anabhi na chitamu cha ngozi, impalika aletakika kwaka mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Mpenganyambiku anaandingalyaje na ngati anachunhimbiki chindu chihuhu panani ja ngozi ambachu chuntendiki majunju kubha mahuhu na ngati kubhili na inyama jibhehi mkati ja chindu chechihimbiki hechi, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />chenihechi nde chitamu cha chikahi chilachu cha ngozi na mpenganyambiku anaantangazaje kubha mhakau. Ngaantengi kabheti, maghambu mundu jonihoju nde mhakau tayali.<verse eid="LEV 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />“Ngati chitamu hechi anachijaghani mu ngozi jaki jokapi ngati mpenganyambiku moanaweza kulola, kubha chijaghanili mu ngozi jokapi jaka mtamwa hoju kutumbu ku lutohutohu mbaka kulwaju, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />mpenganyambiku anaandingalya, na ngati chitamu hechi chijaghanili hyegha jokapi, anaantangaza mundu hoju kubha abhi wichu. Kwa kubha hyegha jokapi jibhi jihuhu, jombi abhi wichu. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Nambu anakubhonakini mu hyegha jaka mundu hoju chilonda chibhehi, bhela mundu hoju anakubha mhakau. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Mpenganyambiku analingalyaje chilonda chibhehi hechi na kuntangaza mundu hoju kubha mhakau, maghambu chenihechi nde chitamu cha malohi. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Nambu chilonda hechi anaching'anabwiki kabheti kubha chihuhu, mundu hoju anajendaje kwaka mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Mpenganyambiku anaandingalyaje, ngati chilonda hechi chibhi chihuhu, mpenganyambiku anaantangaza mundu hoju kubha abhi wichu.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />“Ngati mundu anaabhi na liputi, nalombi analilamiki, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />nambu pandu pala papakabhi na liputi anapahimbiki na kubha pahuhu au anapabhi pakeli, nambu pahuhu pachokopi, impalika kundangiha mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Mpenganyambiku anaandingaje mundu hoju. Mpenganyambiku anaaweni pang'anambwiki kubha na libhomba na majunju gha pandu pala ghang'anambwiki kubha mahuhu, bhela mpenganyambiku anaantangaza mundu hoju kubha mhakau, chenihechi nde chitamu cha malohi ambaghu ghabhokini na liputi heli. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Nambu ngati mpenganyambiku anaandingalili mundu hoju na kubhona kubha majunju gha pandu pala nga mahuhu na wala njeta libhomba, nambu patehi kuhiyala, bhela, anaantengaje mundu hoju kwa machobha saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Ngati chitamu hechi anachijaghanila mu ngozi, bhela mpenganyambiku anaantangaza mundu hoju kubha mhakau, nde chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Nambu ngati pandu pala ngachepajaghanili, bhela, lenilela nde likumba la liputi pela. Mpenganyambiku anaantangazaje mundu hoju kubha abhi wichu.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />“Ngati mundu anapi moto pa ngozi jaki na kupitalila alama jejibhi na ukeli na uhuhu, au alama jihuhu jibhonakini pa inyama jibhehi pala papapile, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />mpenganyambiku anaapalingaje. Ngati anaapaweni kubha majunju ghang'anambwiki kubha mahuhu na pabhi na libhomba, bhela, chenihechi nde chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila ambachu chipitalili panani ya likumba la moto. Mpenganyambiku anaantangazaje mundu hoju kubha mhakau, kwa ndandi abhi na chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Nambu ngati mpenganyambiku anaaweni kubha majunju gha pandu pala nga mahuhu na njeta libhomba nambu patei kuhiyala, bhela, mpenganyambiku anaantengaje mundu hoju kwa machobha saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Lichobha la saba mpenganyambiku anaandinga kabheti na ngati ujaghananila mu ngozi, mpenganyambiku anaantangazaje mundu hoju kubha mhakau, nde chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Nambu, ngati alama jela ngachejang'anambwiki na wala ngachejijaghanile mu ngozi na pombi patei kuhiyala, panihapa pahimbiki kubhokana na kupa moto, bhela mpenganyambiku anaantangazaje mundu hoju kubha abhi wichu, kwa ndandi leniheli nde likumba kubhokana na kupa moto.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />“Anakubhi mwanalomi au mbomba abhi na chilonda panani ja mmutu au pa chileu, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />mpenganyambiku anaachilingaje chilonda hechi na ngati anaaweni kubha chijingi mkati na majunju ghaghabhi panani jaki nde njano na ipepandahu, mpenganyambiku anaantangazaje mundu hoju kubha mhakau, kwa ndandi nde ikwanda, chenihechi nde chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila cha mmutu au chileu. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Nambu ngati mpenganyambiku analingalili ntundu ghonihoghu wa chilonda, anakibhonakini kubha ngachekibhi na libhomba na njeta majunju mapili panani jaki, panihapa antengaje mundu hoju kwa machobha saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Lichobha la saba mpenganyambiku anaandinga chilonda hechi, ngati ikwanda ngacheijaghanili na ngacheabhi na majunju gha manjanu panani jaki wala nga libhomba lokapi lela, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />mundu hoju impalika anamoghakikaje, nambu amoghakika pela pandu papabhili na chitamu, najombi mpenganyambiku anaantenga kwa machobha ghangi saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Lichobha la saba mpenganyambiku anaandingalyaje kabheti chikwanda chela. Na ngati mpenganyambiku anaaweni kubha ikwanda heyi ngacheijaghanili mu ngozi na wala ngacheijingili mkati ja ngozi, bhela mpenganyambiku anaantangazaje mundu hoju kubha abhili wichu. Mundu hoju anaimpalika kuchapa ingobhu yaki, najombi anaakubha wichu. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Nambu anakubhi ikwanda ijaghanili panani ja ngozi paakajomwili kuntangaza kubha abhi wichu, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />mpenganyambiku anaandingalyaje, na ngati ikwanda ijaghanili mu ngozi, mpenganyambiku ngaikubhi na ndandi ja kulingalila ngati kubhi na majunju gha manjanu, mundu jonihoju nde mhakau. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Nambu anangati mpenganyambiku anaaweni kubha ikwanda heyi ilamiki na majunju mapili ghameliki pandu panihapa, bhela, hilonda heyi ilamike, bhela mundu hoju abhi wichu. Mpenganyambiku anaantangazaje mundu hoju kubha abhi wichu.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />“Anakubhi mwanalomi au mbomba abhi na alama jihuhu panani ja ngozi jaki, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />mpenganyambiku andingalyaje mundu hoju, anangati mpenganyambiku anaaweni kubha alama heji nde jihuhu pachokopi, yeniheyi nde hikwanda ya kuhiyala, mundu jonihoju abhi wichu.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />“Ngati mwanalomi apatiki lupanja, jombi abhi wichu, maghambu abhi na lupanja pena. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Ngati lupanja holu lutumbwi kutumbula kunyuma mbaka palongi mundu hoju abhi na lupanja pena, na abhi wichu. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Nambu ngati anaabhi na chilonda chechibhi na ukeli na uhuhu pa mmutu waki ghoubhi na lupanja au palongi ja pamihu, chenihechi nde chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila chechipitalila pamutu au palongi ja pamihu jaki. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Mpenganyambiku anaandingaje, na ngati chilonda chechihimbiki panani ja mmutu waki au palongi ja pamihu jaki nde chikeli au chihuhu ngati chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila, <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />bhela, mundu jonihoju nde mtamwa na jombi nde mhakau. Mpenganyambiku anaantangaza mundu hoju kubha nde mhakau kwa ndandi ja chilonda cha pamutu jaki.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />“Mundu joabhi na chitamu ngati chenihechi cha kujambukila impalika ahwata ingobhu yeikachwiki, ngawammogha majunju ghaki, uyekalyaje pandu pa pahi ja pamihu jaki na alapula njobhela, ‘Nepani nde mhakau! Nepani nde mhakau!’ <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Kwa chikahi chokapi cheanakubha na chitamu hechi cha kujambukila anahighalya kubha nde mhakau. Impalika atama kanjika jaki, jonihoju impalika atengakikaje kunja ja likambi.<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ingobhu yeibhi na ikwanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />“Ngati ingobhu jokapi jela jibhi na majambukilu gha ikwanda, anakubhi ingobhu jejilenganakiki kwa mangoma gha limbeleli au ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />jokapi jela jejilokakiki au kupotwa anajibhi ja ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu au ja mangoma gha limbeleli, chingokolu chokapi chela au chokapi chechilenganakiki kwa chingokolu, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />ngati madoa hagha ghabhi na langi ja mahamba au jikeli mu ingobhu jeniheji, bhela, ghanihagha nde madoa ghaghajaghanila na impalika mpenganyambiku aibhonaje. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Mpenganyambiku anaalingalya madoa ghanihagha na kujibheka punkeghi ingobhu heji kwa machobha saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Lichobha la saba mpenganyambiku anaalingalya madoa ghanihagha, na ngati madoa anaghajaghanili mu ingobhu heji, anakubhi ja kulokakeka au ja kupotwa au ja chingumba au ja chingumba cha ntundu wokapi ghola, ingobhu heji jibhi na malohi. Bhela ingobhu heji nde jihakau. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Mpenganyambiku anaajijocha moto ingobhu heji, jikubhi ja mangoma gha limbeleli au ja kulokakeka, au ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu au kupotwa, au chombu chokapi chela cha ngozi chechibhi na majambukilu, kwa ndandi nde ikwanda yeijonanga, chombu chokapi chela chipalika chijochakika moto.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />“Nambu chikahi mpenganyambiku paachilingaje na kubhona kubha madoa ghala ngacheghajaghanili mu ingobhu jejilokakike au kupotwa, au hindu ya ingokolu, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />anaalaghalakya kubha chindu chechibhi na majambukilu chigholulikaje. Bhela anaachitengaje kwa machobha saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Mpenganyambiku anaalingalya ingobhu heji anajichapakike. Ngati alama ngachejing'anambwiki langi jaki hata ngati madoa ngacheghajaghanili, bhela, ingobhu heji nde jihakau. Ingobhu heji ujijocha moto, hata ngati alama ja madoa anaghabhi kunyuma au kulongi ja ingobhu heji. <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Ngati mpenganyambiku anaaweni kubha alama jela jitei kuhiyala hata ngati ingobhu heji jitehi kuchapakika, bhela akachulaje pandu papajambukiwi pa ingobhu au chingumba au chindu chechilokakiki au kupotwa. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Bhela, anangati alama jibhonakini kabheti panakatahi jaki mu ingobhu jejilokakiki au jejipotwiki au mu chindu chokapi cha ngozi, bhela madoa ghatei kujaghanila. Panihapa ingobhu heji ujijocha moto. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Ingobhu, au chindu chechilokakiki au kupotwa, au chindu chokapi cha chingokolu ambachu chigholuliki na kubhohakeka madoa, ipalika chigholulika kabheti, nachombi anachikubha wichu.”<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Jeniheji nde shelia kubhokana na majambukilu gha madoa mu ingobhu yeilenganakiki kwa mangoma gha limbeleli au ingobhu inyahi ihuhu, yeilokakiki au kupotwa, au chindu chokapi cha chingokolu, kwa ndandi ja kuitangaza kubha ibhi wichu au ihakau.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s">Ugholuleku kuhuma mu chitamu cha ngozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />Aghagha nde malaghalakilu kubhokana na mundu joabhi na chitamu cha malohi mu lichobha la kugholuleka kwaki. Anaajomwi kulama analetakika kwaka mpenganyambiku, <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />mpenganyambiku anajenda kunja ja likambi kundingalila mundu jonihoju. Ngati mundu jonihoju anaalamiki chitamu chaki cha ngozi cha kujambukila, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />panihapa mpenganyambiku anaabhalaghalakya bhandu bhaletaje hijuni ibheli inyahi yeibhi yomi, chipandi cha nkongu wa mwelezi, mangoma makeli gha limbeleli na limbandi la nkongu wa hisopu kwa ndandi jaka mundu joanagholulika hoju. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anaalaghalakya kubha bhachinja chijuni chimu mu chipika chechibhi na machi manyahi gha chemichemi. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anatola chijuni chengi chechibhi chomi hechi, chipandi cha nkongu wa mwelezi, mangoma makeli gha limbeleli na limbandi la nkongu wa hisopu na kuijwiha yokapi mu mwahi wa chijuni chechichinjakiki chela. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Bhela, mpenganyambiku anaammichila mundu joabhi na chitamu cha kujambukila jola mwahi ghonihoghu mala saba na kumtangaza mundu hoju kubha abhi wichu. Bhela anaachilekakya chijuni chechibhi chomi chela chijenda kumighonda.<verse eid="LEV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />Mundu hoju anaachapa ingobhu yaki, anamogha majunju ghaki, na kujogha machi, najombi anaakubha wichu. Anaajomwi kutenda ghanihagha anajenda kulikambi, nambu anaatama kunja ja lihema laki kwa machobha saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Lichobha la saba impalika amogha majunju ghaki ghokapi, yani amogha majunju gha kumutu, indeu yaki, ngopalela yaki, na majunju ghangi ghokapi. Impalika achapaje ingobhu yaki, na ajoghaje kwa machi, najombi anakubha wichu.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />“Lichobha la nane, aletaje bhanambeleli ghabheli makambaku ghangakubha na chilema, mwanambeleli limbomba la chaka chimu langakubha na chilema, kilu itatu ya uhembi laini ghouhangaghinwi na mahuta gha zeituni kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja chilebhi, papamu na mahuta gha zeituni selusi jimu ja lita. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Mpenganyambiku joanaangolula mundu hoju anaandetaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga pambipi na ndyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu papamu na hindu yealetike.<verse eid="LEV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />“Bhela mpenganyambiku anaatola limu la mambeleli makambaku ghala na kulibhoha kubha nyambiku ja mahoku, papamu na mahuta gha zeituni selusi jimu ghala, anaaghajinua palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kubha nyambiku ja kujinuliwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Bhela anaalichinja limbeleli heli mu Pandu Pahuhu, pabhachinji hinyama ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku na nyambiku ja kujochakeka. Nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku heji, ngati mojibhelili nyambiku ja kubhoha mahakau, nde yaka mpenganyambiku, jeniheji nde nyambiku jihuhu namaa. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anaatola pandu pachokopi pa mwahi wa nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku na kumpaka mundu joagholuleka mu nkeghi ja likutu laki la kumalelelu na lukonji lwaki lukolongwa lwa chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu na lukonji lukolongwa lwa chigholu cha kumalelelu. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anaatolaje pandu pa selusi jimu ja mahuta gha zeituni ghala, na kughajeghela pa chighanja cha chiwoku chaki mweni cha kumangeja, <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />anajwiha lukonji lwaki lwa chibhoku cha kumalelelu mu mahuta gha zeituni ghaghabhi pa chighanja chaki, na kwa lukonji loniholu anaammichila mundu hoju joanagholulikaje mala saba palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Mahuta ghaghahighalili pa chighanja chaka mpenganyambiku anaampaka mundu joanagholulika hoju, munkeghi ja likutu laki la kumalelelu na lukonji lwaki lukolongwa lwa chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu, na lukonji lukolongwa lwa chigholu cha kumalelelu, pandu pala pala paakumpakiki mwahi wa nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Mpenganyambiku anaaghapaka mahuta ghaghahighalili pa chighanja chaki panani ja mmutu waka mundu jola joagholuleka, na kutenda ujunganesu kwa ndandi jaka mundu hoju, palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />“Bhela mpenganyambiku anabhoha nyambiku jela ja kubhoha mahoku na kuntendela mundu joagholuleka hoju ujonganesu nahuli kubhoha uhakau waki. Anajomwili kutenda ghanihagha, mpenganyambiku anachinjaje mwanalimbeleli la nyambiku ja kujochakeka, <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />na kujibhoha panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, papamu na nyambiku ja uhembi nahuli kuntendela ujonganesu, najombi anakubha wichu.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />“Nambu ngati mundu hoju nde kahochu, na ngacheabhi na uwezu wa kubhoha hindu yeniheyi, bhela aletaje mwanalimbeleli limu likambaku kubha nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku ambalu anatendiwaje nginyulila ja kubhoha nyambiku nahuli kuntendela mundu hoju ujonganesu. Bhelabhela analetaje kilu jimu ja uhembi laini ghouhangaghinwi na mahuta gha zeituni kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja uhembi na mahuta gha zeituni selusi jimu, <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />na ngunda ibheli au makenda ghabheli gha injebha, chela cheanaweza kupata, jimu kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, na jengi kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka.<verse eid="LEV 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />“Mu lichobha la nane impalika aletaje hindu heyi kwaka mpenganyambiku, kwa ndandi ja kugholuleka kwaki pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Mpenganyambiku anaantola mwanalimbeleli likambaku kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku papamu na selusi jimu ja mahuta gha zeituni gha kujinuliwa palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga ghala kubha nyambiku ja kujinuliwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Mpenganyambiku anaachinjaje mwanalimbeleli likambaku hoju kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. Mpenganyambiku anatola pandu pachokopi pa mwahi na kumpaka mundu joagholuleka hoju punkeghi ja likutu laki la kumalelelu, mu lukonji lwaki lukolongwa lwa chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu, na lukonji lwaki lukolongwa lwa chigholu chaki cha kumalelelu. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anapongulaje pandu pa mahuta pa chighanja cha chiwoku chaki cha kumangeja, <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />na kwa lukonji lwaki lwa kumalelelu anammichilaje mundu hoju pandu pachokopi pa mahuta ghala ghaghabhi pa chighanja chaki cha kumangeja mala saba palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Mpenganyambiku anaampaka mahuta ghaghahighalile pa chighanja chaki mu pandu pokapi ngati moakumpakili mwahi wa nyambiku wa mahoku: Yani punkeghi ja likutu la kumalelelu lwaka jola joagholuleka, mu lukonji lukolongwa lwa chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu, na lukonji lukolongwa lwa chigholu cha kumalelelu. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Mahuta ghaghahighalili mu chiwoku chaki anaampaka mundu hoju pamutu, nahuli kuntendela ibada ja ujonganesu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anaatolaje ngunda jimu pachilanda ja ibheli yela, au injebha ibheli ngati mundu hoju moaweze kuipata, <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />jimu kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja mahoku, na jengi kubha nyambiku ja kujochakeka, papamu na nyambiku ja uhembi. Kwa indela hajeji mpenganyambiku anatenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaka mundu joagholuleka hoju, palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Aghagha nde malaghalakilu kwaka mundu jokapi jola joabhi na chitamu cha ngozi cha kujambukila na ambachu ngachechibhi na uwezu wa kubhoha nyambiku ja kawaida kwa ndandi ja kugholuleka kwaki.<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madoa mu nyumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />Bambo Chapanga akabhapwaghi Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />Pamwijingalaje mu inchi ja Kanaani ambaju numpekeha kubha jinu, nanatu anameka madoa ghaghajaghanila mu nyumba mu inchi jenijela, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />impalika mweni nyumba heji akumpwaghila mpenganyambiku: Nichiweni chindu chechilengana na madoa mu nyumba jangu. <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Mpenganyambiku analaghalakyaje hindu yokapi ibhohakijaje mkati ja nyumba mangani ngacheapiti kulinga ngati jibhi na chitamu chenihechi, nahuli chindu chokapi mkati ja nyumba ngachitangazwa kubha chihakau. Bhela, mpenganyambiku anajingala mkati ja nyumba na kujilingalila nyumba heji. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Mpenganyambiku analingalyaje madoa ghanihagha mu lumatu lwa nyumba heji, najombi ngati anajibhi na langi ja mahamba mabhehi au ukeli na kubhi na mabhomba mkati ja lumatu, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />bhela, mpenganyambiku anapita kunja na kujighila ndyangu wa nyumba heji kwa machobha saba, <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />mu lichobha la saba, mpenganyambiku anakelabhukaje na kujilinga kabheti nyumba. Ngati anaaweni madoa ghajaghanili munani ja lumatu heyi, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />mpenganyambiku analaghalakya kubha maganga ghokapi ghaghajambukiwi ghabhohakikaje na kughalekela pandu papabhi pahakau kunja ja muchi. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Lipu jokapi ja nyumba jeniheji jikojuliwaje na luhombi lwaki kululekela pandu pahakahu kunja ja muchi. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Bhela anabhatola maganga ghangi na kuchenga pandu pabhabombwili, nabhombi anabhamata nyumba heji kwa lipu jahenu.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />Ngati madoa hagha anaghapitalili kabheti chikahi maganga hagha ghabhohakiki na kukwangula lipu heji na kubheka lipu jahenu, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />mpenganyambiku anajendaje kujilingalila na ngati madoa ghajaghanili mkati ja nyumba, bhela ghanihagha nde madoa ghaghayonanga, nyumba jeniheji nde jihakau. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Nyumba heji jipalika jibombuliwaje na maganga ghaki, mikongu jaki na lipu jaki, yokapi ikapelakwaje pandu pahakau kunja ja muchi. <verse eid="LEV 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />“Kabheti mundu jokapi joanajingalaje mkati ja nyumba heji koni jakabya jijighaliki, anakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Mundu jokapi joanaghonilaje mkati ja nyumba heji au kula chilebhi mkati ja nyumba heji impalika achapa ingobhu yaki.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />“Nambu anangati mpenganyambiku anahikiki kujingila mkati ja nyumba na kubhona kubha madoa ngacheghajaghani kabheti kwa kubha nyumba jitehi kumatakika, anaajitangaza nyumba heji kubha jibhi wichu, maghambu madoa ghajomwike. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Nahuli kujigholola nyumba heji, mweni nyumba analeta hijuni ibheli, limbandi la nkongu wa mwelezi, na nyuzi ya mangoma makeli gha limbeleli na limbandi la hisopu. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Mpenganyambiku anachinja chijuni chimu mu chipika chechibhi na machi manyahi gha chemichemi. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anaatola limbandi la nkongu wa mwelezi, limbandi la nkongu wa hisopu, na nyuzi ya mangoma makeli gha limbeleli na chijuni chechibhi chomi, na kuijwiha mkati ja mwahi wa chijuni chechichinjakiki papamu na machi manyahi na kujimichila nyumba jela mala saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Bhenibhela nde ntundu mpenganyambiku moanaajigholula nyumba heji kwa mwahi wa chijuni chela, machi manyahi, chijuni chomi chela, limbandi la nkongu wa mwelezi, limbandi la nkongu wa hisopu na nyuzi ya mangoma makeli gha limbeleli. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Bhela mpenganyambiku anachilekakya chijuni chechibhi chomi chela kulijeka mu mighonda kunja ja muchi. Kwa indela hajeji anatenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi ja nyumba heji, najombi anajikubha wichu.”<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />Aghagha nde malaghalakilu kubhokana na chitamu chokapi chela cha ngozi cha kujambukila, na kunyanya kwa ntundu wokapi ghola, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />madoa gha mu ingobhu au mkati ja nyumba, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />kwa kuhimba, maputi au madoa ghaghang'anya, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />nahuli kulangiha nde chindu bholi chinyahi au chihakau kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Ghanihagha nde malaghalakilu kubhokana ntundu wokapi wa itamwa ya malohi.<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s">Hindu yeyumpita mundu na kuntenda kubha mhakau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Bambo Chapanga akabhapwaghi Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />Mwapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli anana: Mwanalomi jokapi jola anapitikwi na uhila, uhila hoghu anauntenda kubha mhakau. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Na aghagha nde malaghalakilu kubhokana na uhakau hoghu. Chikahi chokapi paapitwa na uhila au uhila paukubha uhibhalakiwi mkati jaki, mundu hoju nde mhakau.<verse eid="LEV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />Chitanda chokapi chela cheanaghonila mundu joapitwa na uhila anachikubha chihakau, na chokapi cheanatamilaje anachikubha chihakau. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Mundu jokapi joanagusa chitanda chaka mundu hoju impalika achapa ingobhu yaki, na ajogha machi, najombi anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Mundu jokapi joanatamila chindu chokapi cheatamili mundu joapitwa na uhila hoju, impalika achapa ingobhu yaki na ajogha machi, na anakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />“ ‘Mundu jokapi joanaangusa mundu joapitwa na uhila, impalika achapa ingobhu yaki na kujogha machi, najombi anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />“ ‘Anakubhi mundu joapitwa na uhila anaanhuni imata mundu jokapi joabhi wichu, mundu joahuniwi imata hoju impalika achapa ingobhu yaki na kujogha machi, najombi anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Kila chindu cha kutamila ambachu mundu hoju anaachikanyataje chikahi cha kutama panani ja chinyama anachikubha chihakau. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Mundu jokapi joanaagusa chindu chokapi cheatami mundu jonihoju, anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. Mundu jokapi joanatotulaje chindu chokapi chechakabhi chaka mundu hoju impalika achapa ingobhu yaki, na kujogha machi, najombi anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />“ ‘Ngati mundu jokapi joanaangusa mundu joapitwa na uhila panga kugholola mabhoku ghaki kwa machi, impalika achapa ingobhu yaki na kujogha machi, najombi anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />“ ‘Chombu chokapi cha lutopi cheanakamula mundu hoju ipalika chikajuliwaje, na kila chombu cha nkongu anachigholuliwa kwa machi.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />“ ‘Mwanalomi jokapi joanapitwa na uhila anaalamiswi chitamu chaki, impalika mundu hoju alendilaje machobha saba mangani ja kugholuleka kwaki. Impalika ajogha machi na kuchapa ingobhu yaki kwa machi gha munkoka, najombi anaagholulikaje. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Lichobha la nane, impalika aletaje ngunda ibheli au mabhunda ghabheli gha injebha, palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu na kumpekeha mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Mpenganyambiku anaibhoha nyambiku, jimu heji kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku na jengi kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka. Kwa indela ajeji anaatenda ujonganesu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kwa ndandi jaka mundu hoju kwa kupitwa kwaki uhila.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />“ ‘Ngati mwanalomi anapitwiki na imbeju ya chikambaku, impalika ajogha machi hyegha jokapi, na anakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Ingobhu jokapi jejiholuliwi na imbeju ya chikambaku au ngozi jokapi jejiholuliwi na imbeju heyi ipalika jigholulika kwa machi, nayombi anaikubha ihakau mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Ngati mwanalomi anaghonili na mbomba, anapitikwi na imbeju ya chikambaku, bhela ipalika bhokapi bhabheli bhajogha machi, nabhombi anabhakubha bhahakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />“ ‘Mbomba jokapi jola paanakubha kumwehi, anaakubha mhakau kwa machobha saba. Mundu jokapi joanaangusa mbomba jonihoju anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />“ ‘Na chindu chokapi cheanaghonalya mu chikahi chaki cha kumwehi anachikubha chihakau, na chokapi cheanatamilaje anachikubha chihakau. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Mundu jokapi joanaangusa chitanda chaka mbomba hoju impalika achapa ingobhu yaki na kujogha machi, najombi anakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Mundu jokapi joanakamula chindu chokapi cheatamili mbomba hoju impalika achapa ingobhu yaki na kujogha machi, najombi anakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Mwanalomi jokapi joanakamula chindu chokapi cheaghonalili au kutamila mbomba hoju, anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />“ ‘Ngati mwanalomi anaghonili na mbomba hoju na mwahi waka mbomba hoju anaunholulili mwanalomi hoju, bhela, mwanalomi hoju anaakubha mhakau kwa machobha saba. Chitanda chokapi chela cheanaghonalya mwanalomi hoju anachikubha chihakau.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />“ ‘Ngati mbomba anapitwa na mwahi kwa chikahi cha machobha ghamaheli kuliku moubhelili ntetu au apitwa na mwahi chikahi nga cha kupitwa mwahi, bhela anajendalyaje kubha mhakau chikahi chokapi mwahi paumpita. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Kila chitanda cheanaghonalya mbomba hoju mu machobha ghokapi gha kupitwa mwahi anachikubha ngati mokubheli kutengwa kwaki, na kila chindu cheanaghonalya anachikubha chihakau, ngati uhakau wa kutengwa kwaki. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Mundu jokapi joanaagusa hindu heyi, anaakubha mhakau na impalika achapa ingobhu yaki na kujogha machi, najombi anaakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="LEV 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />“ ‘Mbomba hoju anaujomiki mwahi waki anaalendalyaje mbaka lichobha la saba nahuli kubha wichu, na anaghajomwiki machobha ghanihagha anaakubha wichu. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Lichobha la nane impalika atola ngunda ibheli au mabhunda ghabheli gha injebha na kughaleta kwaka mpenganyambiku pundyangu wa kujingalila mu Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Mpenganyambiku anabhoha jimu kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku na jengi kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka. Bhela mpenganyambiku anaantendilaje mbomba hoju ujonganesu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga na kumbokeha uhakau waki wa kupitwa mwahi.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />“ ‘Ipalika mubhalakalya Bhaizilaeli kubhokana na hindu ambayu ibhatenda kubha bhahakau, nahuli ngabhipotela mu uhakau wabhu kwa kulihakaa Lihema langu, ambalu libhi pachilanda jabhu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Aghagha nde malaghalakilu kwaka mwanalomi joapitwa na uhila na joapitwa na imbeju chikambaku na kubha mhakau, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />kwa ndandi jaka mbomba joapitwa na mwahi na kubha mhakau. Shelia heyi nde kwa ndandi jaka mwanalomi au mbomba jokapi jola joapitwa na chokapi chela, na kabheti kwa ndandi jaka mwanalomi joaghonela na mbomba ambaju nde mhakau kwa kawaida ja kujojabhela.<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s">Lichobha la ujonganesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />Bambo Chapanga akalongi na Musa baada ja kupotela kwa bhana bhabheli bhaka Haluni bhabhakapotili pabhakaheghalili palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Umpwaghila ndongu waku Haluni ngayihika chikahi chokapi chela paapala jombi mkati ja Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, kunyuma ja lipazia kulongi ja chifuniku cha chiha, chechibhi panani ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, nangabhela anaapotilaje, kwa ndandi mbitalila mkati ja lihundi panani ja chifuniku cha chiha chela. <verse eid="LEV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Anana nde Haluni moanaimpalika kujingila Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi: Atolaje litoli likambaku kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, na limbeleli likambaku kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka.”<verse eid="LEV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />Inaimpalika kujogha machi, na kuhwata ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu. Anaajingala pandu panihapa koni akabya ahwati ingobhu ihuhu: Lijoho linyahi lihuhu, ingobhu ya mkati inyahi ihuhu, na koni akabya ahwati likanzu linyahi lihuhu, na kulikonga kwa ulamba wa ingobhu jihuhu muchibhunu chaki, na mbumbu jinyahi jihuhu kumutu jaki. <verse eid="LEV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Anaatola imbuhi mapongu ghabheli kuhuma kwa bhandu bha Izilaeli kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku na limbeleli likambaku kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka.<verse eid="LEV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />Haluni anaabhoha ng'ombi likambaku heli kwa ndandi ja nyambiku jaki ja kubhoha mahoku, nahuli atendaje ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaki mweni na bhandu bha munyumba jaki. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Bhela, anaatola imbuhi mapongu ghabheli ghala na kughaleta palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Anaalapula kula kwa ndandi ja imbuhi ibheli heyi, jimu kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga na jengi kwa ndandi ja kujipapakila mahoku na kupelekwa kwaka lijobhi Azazeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Haluni anaaleta imbuhi lipongu lela lelihaghuliki kwa kula kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kulibhoha kubha nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Nambu imbuhi jejihaghuliki kwa kula kubha imbuhi jaka lijobhi Azazeli anajibhohakikaje koni jakabya jakali jomi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nahuli jitumika kwa kutenda ujonganesu kwa kujileka jijendaje kulipololu, nahuli kubhoha mahoku gha bhandu bhokapi.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />Haluni anaaleta ng'ombi likambaku lela kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku ghaki mweni, nahuli kutenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaki na bhandu bha munyumba jaki, najombi analichinjaje likambaku la ng'ombi heli kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku ghaki mweni. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Bhela anatola chetezu jejitwelili makalakala ghaghabhele moto kuhuma pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga na mahumbatu ghabheli gha ubani laini ghouyaghakiki na kunungi wichu, na kuipeleka kunyuma ja lipazia. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Anaabheka ubani panani ja moto palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na lyohi la ubani anauyekalyaje chifuniku cha chiha chechibhi panani ja chiyekalelu cha Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, nahuli ngayihika kupotela. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Anaatola pandu pachokapi pa mwahi wa ng'ombi likambaku lela na kujwiha lukonji lwaki na kumichila upambala wa kolipita lyobha panani ja chifuniku cha chiha, bhela anamichilaje palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu mala saba kwa lukonji lwaki.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />Bhela anaachinjaje lipongu la imbuhi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku jela kwa ndandi ja bhandu na kuupeleka mwahi wa lipongu heli kunyuma ja lipazia, na kutenda ngati moakatendi kwa mwahi wa likambaku la ng'ombi lela. Anamichilaje panani ja chifuniku cha chiha, upambala wa palongi jaki. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Kwa indela ajeji anaatenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi ja Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi kwa ndandi ja uhakau wabhu, kulepa kutii kwabhu Bhaizilaeli, na mahoku ghabhu ghokapi. Bhelabhela anaahenga bhenibhela kwa ndandi ja Lihema Lihuhu, ambalu libhi pachilanda ja bhandu bhanihabha bhahakau. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Mundu jokapi ngacheapalika kubha mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu, kutumbula chikahi Haluni paajingila kutenda ujonganesu mu Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi mbaka payipita kunja, chikahi anaajomwi kulitendela ujonganesu mweni, bhandu bha munyumba jaki papamu na lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Bhela anaapitaje na kujenda pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku jela jejibhi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga na kutenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaki. Anaatolaje pandu pachokopi pa mwahi wa ng'ombi likambaku na pandu pachokopi pa mwahi wa lipongu la imbuhi, na kuupaka mu manyelu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Haluni anaamicha mwahi wakumu panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa lukonji lwaki mala saba nahuli kupagholola na kupabheka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kubhokana na uhakau wa bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuhi ja Azazeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />Haluni payikubha ajomwili kutenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi ja Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, Lihema Lihuhu na pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, anaaletaje palongi lipongu la imbuhi kwa ndandi jaka Azazeli, koni jakabya jomi. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Haluni anaabheka mabhoku ghaki ghabheli panani ja mmutu wa imbuhi jejibhi jomi na kujetakela panani jaki uhakau wokapi, kulepa kutii kwa Bhaizilaeli, yani mahoku ghabhu ghokapi, nahuli kughabheka panani ja mmutu wa imbuhi heji. Panihapa anaajilekakya imbuhi heji nahuli jitililaje kulipololu, kwa kulolakewa na mundu joapekiwi lihengu leniheli. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Anaajilekakya imbuhi jela jijendaje kulipololu, pandu pangakubha na bhandu, jakabya jitoliki mahoku ghokapi gha bhandu, na mundu jola anajilekakyaje likembalyaje kulipololu.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />“Bhela Haluni anajendaje mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu na kuhula ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu jela jeakahwatiki mangani ja kujingila Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, na kuileka panihapa. <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />Anaajogha mkati mu Pandu Pahuhu na kuhwata ingobhu yaki. Bhela anaapitaji na kubhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa ndandi jaki mweni, na nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa ndandi ja bhandu bha Izilaeli, nahuli kutenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaki mweni, na kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Bhelabhela anaajocha mahuta gha chinyama cha nyambiku ja kujochakeka panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ja kujochakeka. <verse eid="LEV 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />Mundu jola joalihindaki lipongu la imbuhi laka Azazeli jola, kutumbula achapa ingobhu yaki, na kujogha machi, panihapa nde anaaweza kujingila mu likambi. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Ng'ombi likambaku lela na lipongu la imbuhi yeyabhohakiki kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ya kubhoha mahoku, ambayu mwahi wabhu ukabhi uletakiki Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi kwa ndandi ja kutenda ujonganesu, ipalika ipihakika kunja ja likambi. Ingokolu yabhu, inyama, na matumbu ghaki papamu na imahi anaijochikika kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Mundu jola joanayijochaje achapa ingobhu yaki, na kujogha machi, panihapa anaaweza kujingila mu likambi.<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu wa ujonganesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />“Haleli analikubha lilaghalakilu la mileli kwa ndandi jinu: Mu lichobha la komi la mwehi wa saba, impalika nkongaje, na ngamwihenga lihengu lokapi lela, akubhi mbelakeka au ngeni jokapi jola joatama pachilanda jinu, <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />kwa ndandi lichobha leniheli ujonganesu anautendakikaje kwa ndandi jinu, nahuli kungolola. Bhela, mwehapa anamgholulikaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, kubhokana na mahoku ghinu ghokapi. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Lichobha leniheli nde Sabato ja kupomulela, impalika nkongaje, jeniheji nde amuli ja mileli. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Mpenganyambiku joapakakiki mahuta na kubhekakeka palongi jaka Chapanga nahuli kutola pandu paka tati waki ngati mpenganyambiku nde joanatenda ujonganesu. Impalika ahwataje ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />na kutenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi ja Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, Lihema Lihuhu na pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kujochakeka. Bhelabhela anaatenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi ja bhapenganyambiku, papamu na lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />“Jeniheji anajikubha amuli ja mileli kwinu. Ujonganesu anautendakika mala punkamu pena kwa chaka kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghokapi gha bhandu bha Izilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">Bhenibhela nde mokwahengakike, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s">Kukanakiwa kula mwahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />Umpwaghila Haluni na bhana bhaki, na bhandu bhokapi bha Bhaizilaeli amuli ayeyi: Haleli nde lealaghalakile Bambo Chapanga: <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Ngati mundu jokapi jola pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli anabhohiki nyambiku ja lipongu la ng'ombi au mwanalimbeleli au imbuhi mkati ja likambi au kunja ja likambi, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />wala ngachealiletiki pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu, nahuli kuleta kubha ngati nyambiku kwaka Bambo Chapanga palongi ja Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, mundu jonihoju anabhalangika kubha na mahoku gha kukoma, na mundu jonihoju anatengakika kutali na bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Ndandi ja amuli jenjenu nde kubha Bhaizilaeli ibhapalika bhundetila Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ja kujochakeka yebhatenda sajenu pandu palanga kumighonda. Ibhapalika bhaletaje kwa bhapenganyambiku, yani kwaka Bambo Chapanga, pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu na kubhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka ngati nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwale. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Najombi mpenganyambiku anamichila mwahi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku paka Bambo Chapanga, pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu, na kughajocha mahuta ghala, ghakubha unungilu unyahi wa kunyambiha Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli anabhakotuka kubhoha nyambiku kwa ichapanga nayengi yeilengana na imong'umong'u ya imbuhi, lijambu ambalu labhatendiki bhalepa kubha na ulongwana kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Hajeji anajikubha amuli ja mileli kwa ibheleku yabhu yokapi yeihika.<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />Ubhapwaghilaje: Mundu jokapi jola pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli au ngeni joatama pachilanda jabhu, joabhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka au nyambiku yengi, <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />panga kuleta pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu nahuli kubhoha nyambiku kwaka Bambo Chapanga, mundu jonihoju impalika atengakika kutali na bhandu bhaki.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />Ngati mundu jokapi jola pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli au ngeni joatama pachilanda jabhu, anaakuliki mwahi, wa ntundu wokapi ghola, nepani ananunkana mundu jonihoju joakula mwahi, na kuntenga kutali na bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Maghambu womi wa chiumbi ubhi mkati ja mwahi, nanatu numpekihi mwahi hoghu nahuli mtendilaje ujonganesu kwa ndandi jinu mabheti panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. Mwahi nde ghouhenga ujonganesu kwa ndandi ja matamu ghaka mundu. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Kwa ndandi jeniheji, nabhapwaghi bhandu bha Izilaeli, “Njeta mundu hata jumu pachilanda jinu joapalika kula mwahi, wala ngeni joatama pachilanda jinu ngacheapalika kula mwahi.”<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />Mundu jokapi jola pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli au ngeni joatama pachilanda jabhu anapiti kubhenga chinyama au chijuni, chechipalika kula impalika ajitala mwahi pahi na kuyelalela kwa luhombi. <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Maghambu womi wa kila chiumbi ubhi mu mwahi waki. Nde ndandi nabhapwaghi bhandu bha Izilaeli, “Ngamwikula mwahi wa chiumbi chokapi chela ng'o, maghambu womi wa kila chiumbi ubhi mkati ja mwahi waki. Mundu jokapi jola joanakula mwahi impalika atengakika kutali na bhandu bhaki.”<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />Mundu jokapi jola akubhi mbelekeka au ngeni, joanakula chindu chokapi chela chechiwi cheni, au chechikomakiki na chinyama cha muchitengu, impalika achapa ingobhu yaki na kujogha machi, najombi anakubha mhakau kwa ntundu wa ibada mbaka pakamihi, panihapa anakubha wichu. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Nambu ngati ngacheachapiki ingobhu yaki na kujogha machi, mundu jonihoju anaimpalika kutemuliwa kwa lihoku laki.<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s">Kuhimangana kihyegha chihanganyuma cha shelia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />Ubhapwaghila bhandu bha Izilaeli anana, “Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Ngamwitenda ngati mobhatende bhandu bha ku inchi ja Misili, pandu pamukabhi mtama, wala ngamwitenda ngati mobhatende bhandu bha ku inchi ja Kanaani, pandu panumpeleka. Ngamwijengalela matendu ghabhu ng'o. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Mwehapa impalika kughakamula malaghalakilu ghangu, amuli yangu, na kuijengalela. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Bhela, nkamulaje amuli yangu na shelia yangu, maghambu mundu joakamula anaatama kwa yeniheyi. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />Mundu jokapi wa Izilaeli ngacheapalika kunheghalela ndongu waki wa pambipi nahuli kughone naku kihyegha. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />Ngawanhekatela utopelu tati waku kwa kughone kihyegha na mabhu waku wa kukubheleka. Jombi nde mabhu waku, bhela, ngawihenga naku kihengu chenihechi.<verse eid="LEV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />Ngawighone kihyegha na nhwanu waka tati waku, kuhenga bhenibhela anakuhekata utopelu waka tati waku. <verse eid="LEV 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />Ngawighone chihyegha na ndombu waku, akubhi nde ndombu waku wa lutumbu lumu au ndombu waku kwaka mabhu jongi. <verse eid="LEV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />Ngawighone kihyegha na nchokolu waku wa chimbomba, mwana waka mwana waku au kamwali waku, maghambu kuhenga bhenibhela unakuhekata utopelu waku. <verse eid="LEV 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />Ngawighone kihyegha na mwali joabhelakiki na mabhu waku najongi joatoghuliki na tati waku. Mwali jonihoju nde ndombu waku. <verse eid="LEV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />Ngawighone kihyegha na anihenga waku, maghambu jonihoju nde ndombu waka tati waku. <verse eid="LEV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />Ngawighone kihyegha na ndombu waka mabhu waku ng'o, maghambu jonihoju nde ndongu wa pambipi waka mabhu waku. <verse eid="LEV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />Ngawighone kihyegha na nhwanu waka tati waku nkolongwa au waka tati waku nchoku, maghambu jonihoju nde mabhu waku. <verse eid="LEV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />Ngawighone kihyegha na nhwanu waka mwana waku, maghambu jonihoju nde nhwanu waka mwana waku. Ngawihenga naku kihengu chenihechi. <verse eid="LEV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />Ngawighone kihyegha na nhwanu waka mbeli waku, maghambu jonihoju nde ndamu waku. <verse eid="LEV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />Ngawighone kihyegha na mbomba, kabhete na mwali waki. Ngawighone kihyegha na mwali waka mwana waki wa chikambaku au mwali waka mwali waki. Bhanihabha nde bhalongu bhaki bha pambipi. Kuhenga bhenibhela nde uhakau. <verse eid="LEV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />Ngawantoghola ndombu waka nhwanu waku chikahi nhwanu waku akali mwomi, kuhenga bhenibhela anakuleta malochanu.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />Ngawanheghalela mbomba nahuli kuhimangana naku kihyegha chikahi cha machobha ghaki gha kumwehi. <verse eid="LEV 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />Ngawihimangana kihyegha na nhwanu waka njaku, na kulijeghe uhakau kwaki. <verse eid="LEV 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />Ngawamboha mwana waku jokapi jola kubha nyambiku kwaka kichapanga Moleki, maghambu kuhenga bhenibhela anaulitondula lihina langu nepani Chapanga waku. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku. <verse eid="LEV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />Ngawighone kihyegha na mwanalomi njaku, ngati mouhimanganila na mbomba, leniheli nde lihakalilu. <verse eid="LEV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />Ngawighonela kihyegha na chinyama, na kulijeghe uhakau kwaki. Wala mbomba ngaalipeleka kwa chinyama nahuli kughone naku kihyegha, konihoku nde kuhobha.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />Ngamwalijeghe uhakau kwa indela jokapi jela kwa kuhenga mambu ghanihagha, maghambu mambu ghanihagha nde ghaghandenda nabhatopula bhandu bha inchi yeibhi palongi jinu, ndandi bhombi bhaghahenga ghanihagha na kulijeghe uhakau. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Hata inchi jakajeghaliki uhakau, bhela nakajilapwili kwa mahoku ghaki, najombi inchi jakabhatapiki bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Nambu mwehapa na bhagheni bhabhatama pachilanda jinu impalika kukamula amuli yangu na shelia yangu, wala ngamwihenga hata limu la mahakalilu ghanihagha. <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />Kwa kubha mambu ghanihagha ghokapi ghakahengakiki na bhandu bhabhakatami mu inchi ja Kanaani mangani jinu, na inchi jakabhi jihakau. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Bhela, mwehapa ngamwihenga mambu ghanihagha, nangabhela inchi jenjenu anajunkana ngati mojakabhakani bhandu bha inchi bhabhakabhi bhatama monihomu mangani jinu mwehapa. <verse eid="LEV 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />Kila mundu joanatendaje limu la mahakalilu ghanihagha, bhandu bhanihabha ibhapalika bhatengakika kutali na bhandu bhabhu.<verse eid="LEV 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />“Nkamula malaghalakilu ghangu, wala ngamwijengalela ntetu wa mahakalilu ghokapi ghala ghaghatendakiki mangani ngachemuhikiki mu inchi jenjenu, na kulijegha uhakau kwa ghanihagha. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s">Shelia patali patali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />Ulongila na lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli anana, “Mkubha bhahuhu, maghambu nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde mhuhu. <verse eid="LEV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />Kila jumu winu impalika antopila mabhu waki na tati waki, na impalika kuikamula Sabato yangu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />“Ngamwijojabhela imong'umong'u, wala ngamwalilenganakela ichapanga ya shaba. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />“Pamboha nyambiku ja chinyama ja kujochakeka na nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwali kwaka Bambo Chapanga, mbohaje kwa ntundu ghoupalika nahuli mpata kujetakalewa. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Nyambiku jeniheji nkula mu lichobha leleli lemboha au chilabhu jaki. Chokapi chechihighalyaje mbaka lichobha la katatu chipalika chijochakika kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Ngati pandu pokapi pala pa nyambiku heji anajilelakiki mu lichobha la katatu, chihengu chenihechi nde lihakalilu, na nyambiku heji ngajijetakalewi. <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Mundu jokapi jola joanakulaje inyama heji anakubha mhakau, kwa ndandi achihakihi chindu chechibhi chihuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Mundu jonihoju ipalika atengakika kutali na bhandu bhaki.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />“Chikahi pauhuna mahunu ghaku gha inchi jaku, ngawihuna mbaka mu malindakanilu gha ngonda waku, wala ngawibhongana mahighalilu gha mahunu ghaku. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Ngawikelabhukila mala ja kabheli mu ngonda waku wa mizabibu, wala ngawitondola zabibu yeihawiki pahi. Ilekaje kwa ndandi ja akahochu na bhagheni. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />“Ngawijibha, wala ngawikoloha, wala ngawipwaghani upuhe. <verse eid="LEV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />Ngawilapa kwa upuhi kwa lihina langu, na bhela kulijeghe uhakau lihina laka Chapanga waku. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />“Ngawitola chindu chaka njaku kwa makili, wala ngawanjibhi njaku. Ngawikamulakila malepu ghaka ntumika waku ikilu kelukelu mbaka lukela. <verse eid="LEV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />Ngawampekeha masolu ngajowa, wala ngawibheka chihibhalakilu palongi jaka ngalola, nambu unjoghupa Chapanga waku. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />“Paubhoha utemulu ubhohaje ngati moipalakila, ngawampendalela kahochu, wala kumpendalela joabhi na cheu, nambu untemula njaku ngati moipalakila.<verse eid="LEV 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />“Ngawijenda hakoku na kola koni ukalanda ukolukelu pachilanda ja bhandu bhaku. Ngawitenda chindu chokapi chela cha kughatenda matamu ghaka njaku kubha muhatali ja kupotela. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />“Ngawanhakalila njaku muntima waku, nambu ujongana na njaku chikahi chokapi nahuli ngawihika kutenda mahoku kwa ndandi jaki. <verse eid="LEV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />Ngawikelabhukila uhakau kwa uhakau, wala kumuyomela jumu wa bhandu bhaku muntima waku, nambu umpala njaku ngati moulipali wamwete. Nepani nde Bamabo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />“Impalika kukamula amuli yangu. Ngawaileka hinyama yaku ya kudima ibhelakanaje na hinyama ya ntundu naghongi. Ngawipanda imbeju ya ntundu ubheli mu ngonda waku. Ngawiwata ingobhu jejilokakiwi kwa uzi wa langi ibheli patali patali.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />“Ngati mwanalomi anaghonili kihyegha na mbomba ambaju nde kamwali ntumwa joabhohakiki hweku na mwanalomi jongi, nambu akali ngacheakombuliwi wala ngacheabhi wa kulijeka, ipalika pakubhaje na utemulu ghoupalika. Hata bhela ngabhikomakeka, maghambu mwali hoju akabhi akona ngacheabhekakiki wa kulijeka. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Hata bhela mwanalomi jonihoju impalika aleta limbeleli likambaku pundyanu wa Lihema Lihuhu kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Papamu na limbeleli likambaku la nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku, mpenganyambiku anatenda ujonganesu kwa ndandi jaki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghaatendiki mundu hoju, najombi mundu hoju analekakiwaje mahoku ghaki.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />“Pamwijingala mu inchi heji na kupanda ntundu wokapi ghola wa mikongu ja mapambiku, ngamwikula mapambiku ghaki. Kwa chikahi cha hyaka itatu mughabhalanga mapambiku hagha kubha ngati ghatehi kukanakiwa, ngamwikula mapambiku ghanihagha. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Mu chaka cha kachechi mapambiku ghokapi gha nkongu ghonihoghu anaghakubha mahuhu, kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kundumbalila Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Nambu mu chaka cha kahanu muweza kula mapambiku gha nkongu ghonihoghu. Anamtendiki bhenibhela mahunu ghinu anaghajonjukikaje. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />“Ngamwikula inyama jokapi jela jejibhi na mwahi mkati jaki. Ngamwilondola, wala ngamwihenga uhabhi. <verse eid="LEV 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />Majunju gha mmutu ngaghimoghakeka lipanki, wala kumogha munkeghi ja indehu hinu. <verse eid="LEV 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />Ngamwilemba nembu hyegha hinu kwa ndandi ja bhakuwa, wala ngamwichola alama jokapi jela yani tatuu panani ja hyegha hinu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />“Ngawampoha lihamu mwali waku kwa kuntenda kubha nkemi, nangabhela inchi anajing'anambukya ukemi na kutwelela uhakau. <verse eid="LEV 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />Ukamulaje Sabato yangu, na kupatopela pandu pangu pahuhu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />“Ngamwijenda kwa bhabhabhi na majobhi, wala bhahabhi, nahuli kubhalobha bhundondulyaje, na bhela kulijeghe uhakau. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />“Paukubha palongi jaka hokomundu ujemaje, kulangiha utopelu kwa bhacheya, nanau unjoghupa Chapanga waku. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />“Ngati anakubhi na ngeni mu inchi jaku ngawanhengela lihaha. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Ngeni joatama papamu na wehapa ipalika unhengila ngati jumu wa bhabhelakeka bha inchi jaku. Umpala ngati moulipali wamwete, kwa ndandi nanau ukabhi ungeni ku inchi ja Misili. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />“Ngawitumila hipemu ya kukoloha paupema hipemu ya ulachu, paupema kutopa, wala paupema wamaheli. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Utumila chipemu cha chakaka, maganga gha kupemela kutopa ghakubha gha chakaka, efa ja chakaka, na hini ja chakaka. Nepani nde Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nenumbohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="LEV 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />Nkamulaje shelia yangu yokapi, na amuli yangu yokapi, na kuitenda. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s">Utemulu kwa ndandi ja mahoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />Bambo akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli anana, “Muizilaeli jokapi jola au ngeni joatama mu Izilaeli, joanaamboha jokapi pachilanda ja bhana bhaki kubha nyambiku kwa kichapanga Moleki, mundu jonihoju impalika kukomakeka. Bhenehi bha inchi jeniheji anabhunkoma kwa kundapu maganga. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Nepani ananiyomaje kwa ndandi jaka mundu jonihoju, na kuntenga kutali na bhandu bhaki. Kwa ndandi akumbohiki jumu wa bhana bhaki kubha nyambiku kwaka kichapanga Moleki, na bhela kupahakaha pandu pangu pahuhu, na kulijeghe uhakau lihina langu lihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Ngati bhenehi bha pandu panihapa ngabhantemuli mundu jonihoju kwa kunkoma, chikahi paanaamboha jumu wa bhana bhaki na kumpekeha kichapanga Moleki, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />nepani namweti ananimuyomila mundu hoju papamu na bhandu bha munyumba jaki. Ananabhatenga kutali na bhandu bhabhu, jombi papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhabhatendiki ukemi na kichapanga Moleki.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />“Mundu jola joabhajendela bhabhabhi na majobhi, na bhahabhi, nahuli kulobha ujangatilu kwabhu, ananimuyomilaje mundu hoju, na kuntenga kutali na bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="LEV 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />Bhela, muligholulaje, nanamu anamkubha bhahuhu, maghambu nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Nkamulaje amuli yangu na kuitenda. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, nenuntenda mwehapa kubha bhahuhu.”<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />Anakubhi mundu jokapi andobhela masolu tati waki au mabhu waki, impalika akomakikaje. Ampekihi masolu tati waki au mabhu waki, bhela mwahi waki anaukubha panani jaki mweni.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />Ngati mwanalomi anatenda ugone na nhwanu waka njaki, ibhapalika bhokapi bhabheli bhakomakikaje.<verse eid="LEV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />Mwanalomi anaghonile kihyegha na nhwanu waka tati waki, ngacheantopili tati waki. Mwanalomi jonihoju na mbomba jonihoju bhokapi bhabheli bhakomakikaje. Mwahi wabhu anaukubha panani ja mimutu jabhu bheni. <verse eid="LEV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />Ngati mwanalomi jokapi jola anaghoni kihyegha na nhwanu waka mwana waki, bhokapi bhabheli ibhapalika bhakomakikaje. Chebhatendiki nde chihakau namaa, na mwahi wabhu anaukubha panani ja mimutu jabhu bheni.<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />Ngati mwanalomi anaghoni kihyegha na mwanalomi njaki ngati bhela mwanalomi moatendela kwaka mbomba, akanalomi bhokapi bhabheli habha bhatendiki lelibhi lihakalilu namaa. Chakaka ibhapalika bhakomakikaje, na mwahi wabhu anaakubha panani ja mimutu jabhu bheni. <verse eid="LEV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />Ngati mwanalomi anaantowili mwali papamu na mabhu waka mwali hoju, ghonihoghu nde uhakau. Bhokapi bhatatu ibhapalika bhajochakika kwa moto, nahuli ngakwikubha na uhakau pachilanda jinu. <verse eid="LEV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />Ngati mwanalomi anaghoni kihyegha na chinyama, mwanalomi hoju impalika akomakikaje, bhelabhela na chinyama hechi ipalika chikomakikaje. <verse eid="LEV 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />Ngati mbomba anaachiheghalili chinyama na kughonela nachu kihyegha, munkoma mbomba hoju papamu na chinyama hechi. Ipalika mbomba hoju akomakikaje na chinyama chikomakikaje, na mwahi wabhu anaukubha panani ja mimutu jabhu.<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />“Ngati mwanalomi jokapi jola anaantowi ndombu waki, mwali joabhelakiki na tati waki au mabhu waki, nabhombi anabhaghoni kihyegha, leniheli nde lihakalilu. Ibhapalika kutengakeka kutali na bhandu bhabhu. Mwanalomi hoju ampohiki lihamu ndombu waki, bhela anatemulikaje kwa lihoku leniheli. <verse eid="LEV 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />Ngati mwanalomi anaghoni kihyegha na mbomba joabhi mu lichobha la ntetu wa kimbomba, bhokapi bhabheli ibhapalika kutengakeka kutali na bhandu bhabhu, maghambu mwanalomi hoju aghoni na mbomba joabhi mu lichobha la ntetu wa chimbomba, na mbomba hoju aghoni na mwanalomi akabya mu lichobha la ntetu wa chimbomba.<verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />“Ngawighone kihyegha na ndombu waka mabhu waku, wala nihenga waku, kwa ndandi leniheli analabhapoha lihamu bhandu bha pambipi jaku. Bhokapi bhabhahenga bhenibhela anabhatemuliwaje kwa ndandi ja uhakau wabhu. <verse eid="LEV 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />Ngati mwanalomi anaghoni kihyegha na nihenga waki, jonihoju ampohiki lihamu ndomi waka nihenga waki. Nabhombi anabhatemulikaje kwa lihoku leniheli, bhokapi bhabheli anabhapotilaje panga kubheleka mwana. <verse eid="LEV 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />Ngati mwanalomi anaantowili nhwanu waka ndongu waki, leniheli nde litendu lihakau, na ampohiki lihamu ndongu waki, bhokapi bhabheli anabhapotilaje panga kubheleka mwana.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />“Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, ‘Impalika kutii amuli yangu yokapi, na shelia yangu yokapi, na kuijengalela, nahuli inchi jenundeta kutama ngajunkana. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Ngamwitama kwa kujengalela mitetu ja bhandu bha inchi nayengi bhanabhatopola palongi jinu. Maghambu bhombi bhakahengiki mambu ghanihagha, nanatu nakabhahakali namaa. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Nambu nukumpwaghi mwehapa, “Anamtama mu inchi jabhu, nanatu ananumpekya mwehapa kubha inchi jinu, inchi jinyahi kwa kulema na kudima.” Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nenuntengiki kuhuma kwa bhandu bha inchi nayengi. <verse eid="LEV 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />Bhela, impalika kuhaghula pachilanda ja hinyama hinyahi na hinyama ihakau, bhelabhela pachilanda ja hijuni hinyahi na hijuni ihakau. Ngamwalijeghe uhakau kubhokana na chinyama chokapi chela, au chijuni, wala chindu chokapi chela chechikwabha panani ja inchi, yela yenitengiki kubha nde ihakau kwa ndandi jinu. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Anankubha bhahuhu kwangu, maghambu nepani Bambo Chapanga, nde mhuhu, nanatu nuntengiki kuhuma kwa bhandu bha inchi nayengi nahuli mkubha mabhandu bhangu.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />“ ‘Mwanalomi au mbomba jokapi jola joabhi nhwabhi, impalika akomakikaje kwa kulapulika na maganga. Mubhalapula kwa maganga, na mwahi wabhu anaukubha panani ja mimutu jabhu bheni.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s">Shelia kwa bhapenganyambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa: Ubhapwaghila bhapenganyambiku, bhana bhaka Haluni, “Mpenganyambiku ngaalijeghe uhakau kwa ntundu wa kujojabhela, kwa kukamula ntuhi waka mundu waki joapotile, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />nambu pela ngati ntuhi hoghu nde waka ndongu waki wa pambipi, yani mabhu waki na tati waki, mwana waki au mwali waki, ndongu waki wa chikambaku, <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />au ndombu waki jwangakutoghuleka joantegamela kwa kubha ngacheabhi na ndomi waki, kwa ndandi ja bhanihabha aweza kulijeghe uhakau kwa kukamu mituhi jabhu. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Ngaalijeghe uhakau mweni kubhokana na bhandu bhala ambabhu abhi na ulongu nabhu kwa kutoghulana, kuhenga bhenibhela anakunjeghala uhakau.<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />“Bhapenganyambiku ngabhimogha lupanja, wala ngabhimogha munkeghi ja indehu yabhu au kulichanja nembu mu hyegha yabhu. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Ibhapalika bhakubha bhahuhu kwaka Chapanga wabhu, ngabhalijeghe uhakau lihina laka Chapanga wabhu ng'o. Maghambu bhombi nde bhabhabhoha nyambiku ya kujochakeka kwa moto kwaka Bambo Chapanga, chilebhi chaka Chapanga wabhu, bhela ibhapalika bhakubha bhahuhu. <verse eid="LEV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />Bhapenganyambiku ngabhantogho mbomba nkemi, au joapekiwi baluwa ja kulekana na ndomi waki, maghambu mpenganyambiku nde mhuhu kwaka Chapanga waki. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Mwabhonaje bhapenganyambiku kubha nde bhahuhu, kwa ndandi nde bhabhabhoha chilebhi chaka Chapanga winu. Nkombukaje kubha nde bhahuhu, kwa ndandi nepani Bambo Chapanga nenungolola mwehapa nde mhuhu. <verse eid="LEV 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />Ngati mwali jokapi jola waka mpenganyambiku anaalijeghi uhakau kwa kutenda ukemi, ipalika ajochakika kwa moto mbaka kupotela, maghambu ampoha lihamu tati waki.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />“Mpenganyambiku Nkolongwa, joatama pachilanda ja bhalongu bhaki, joajomwili kujeghaleka mahuta gha kupaka panani ja mmutu waki na joabhekakiki palongi jaka Chapanga nahuli kuhwata ingobhu ya kipenganyambiku, ngaaghaleka majunju ghaki panga kuyekalela, wala ngaikachula ingobhu yaki nahuli kuombuleza. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Ngayijingila mkati pandu papabhi na ntuhi ng'o. Hata ngati ntuhi hoghu ukubhi waka tati waki au waka mabhu waki, nahuli ngaalijeghe uhakau, <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />wala ngayibhoka pandu pahuhu paka Chapanga waki au kupajeghe uhakau, maghambu abhekakiki palongi jaka Chapanga kwa kupakakika mahuta ghaka Chapanga waki. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />Mpenganyambiku Nkolongwa impalika antoghula kamwali lenda pena. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Mpenganyambiku ngaantoghola mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi waki, au mbomba joapekiwi baluwa ja kulekana, wala mbomba joalihakihi kwa ukemi, nambu anaantoghula pena kamwali lenda kuhuma pachilanda ja bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />Bhela ngaabhajegheli uhakau bhana bhaki pachilanda ja bhandu bhaki. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, nenuntenda kubha mhuhu.”<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“Umpwaghila Haluni anana: ‘Kwa hibheleku yeihika njeta mbelakeka waku joabhi na chilema joanaheghalyaje kubhoha chilebhi chaka Chapanga waki. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Mundu jokapi joabhi na chilema ngayiheghalela kumokeha nyambiku: Akubhi ngalola, jotengwiki, joayonangiki pamihu, au jwangakubha na ihungu yeijaghanile, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />njeta mundu joatunywiki chigholu au joatunywiki chiwoku, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />au joabhi na chipendi au joayakatalili, au joalwala mihu, au joabhi na chitamu cha ngozi, au joabhi na uhimba ghoubhi na uhila au maputi, au joahekitwi ntondola. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Njeta chibheleku chaka mpenganyambiku Haluni joabhi na chilema chokapi chela joanaheghalyaje kubhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Ngati anabhi na chilema, ngayihelalela kubhoha chilebhi chaka Chapanga waki ng'o. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Mundu jonihoju aweza kula chilebhi chihuhu chaka Chapanga waki, hata chilebhi chihuhu nakanopi. <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />Nambu kwa ndandi ja chilema chaki, ngayiheghalela pambipi na lipazia wala kuheghalela pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ng'o, ngayihika kupahakaha pandu pangu pahuhu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga nenuntenda kubha bhahuhu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Bhela, Musa akumpwaghi Haluni lijambu leniheli, na bhana bhaki papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s">Uhuhu wa nhupu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa: <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />Umpwaghila Haluni na bhana bhaki bhapenganyambiku bhaitopilaje hindu ambayu Bhaizilaeli bhaibhekiki palongi jaka Chapanga, nahuli ngabhalijeghe uhakau lihina langu lihuhu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />Ubhapwaghila anana: Mu hibheleku yeihika, anakubhi mundu jokapi jola pachilanda ja bhabhelakeka bhaku nde mhakau kwa ntetu wa kujojabhela, najombi anaajiheghali nyambiku jihuhu jebhaleta bhandu bha Izilaeli palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, mundu jonihoju anaatengakika kutali na nepani. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />“Mundu jokapi jola mu chibheleku chaka Haluni anaabhi na chitamu cha ngozi chekijambukila, au ngati apitwa na uhila muhyegha, ngayiwezi kula nyambiku jihuhu mbaka agholulikaje. Bhelabhela anakubha mhakau ngati anaagusiki chindu chokapi chela chechibhi chihakau kwa kugusa mtuhi au mundu joapitikwi na imbeju yaki, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />au ngati anaagusiki chindu chokapi chela chechikwabha chechuntenda mundu kubha mhakau, au mundu jokapi joaweza kunjeghe uhakau, kwa uhakau wa ntundu wokapi ghola. <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />Mundu joakamula chindu chokapi chela cha ntundu ghonihoghu anakubha mhakau mbaka pakamihe. Ngayikuli nyambiku jokapi jela jihuhu ng'o, mbaka akubha ajoghiki machi. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Chikahi lyobha palijibhalaje panihapa anakubha wichu. Anajomwili kutenda ghanihagha anaweza kula ilebhi ihuhu, kwa ndandi chenihechi nde chilebhi chaki. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Ngayikula ntuhi wa chinyama ng'o, wala chechikomakiki na chinyama cha muchitengu, ngayihika kujeghaleka uhakau kwa chenihechi. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />“Bhela bhapenganyambiku ibhapalika bhakamulaje malaghalakilu ghangu, nahuli ngabhikubha na mahakau, na kupotela kwa kughajojoha. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga nenuntenda kubha bhahuhu.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />“Mundu jwangakubha wa lukolu lwaka mpenganyambiku ngacheapalika kula chilebhi chihuhu. Hata ngeni waka mpenganyambiku au muhengalihengu waki ngacheapalika kula. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Nambu anakubhi mpenganyambiku anhemili ntumwa kwa mbija, au ntumwa abhelakiki munyumba jaka mpenganyambiku hoju, ntumwa hoju aweza kula chilebhi chaka mpenganyambiku hechi. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Ngati mwali waka mpenganyambiku atoghuliki na mundu jwangakubha mpenyambiku, mwali hoju ngacheapalika kula nyambiku ja hindu ihuhu. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Nambu anakubhi mwali waka mpenganyambiku aweliwi na ndomi au apekiwi baluwa ja kulekana, najombi ngachebhi na bhana, anaakelawiki kutama na bhalongu bhaka tati waki ngati chikahi cha umwali waki, mwali hoju aweza kula chilebhi chaka tati waki. Hata bhela, ngeni ngacheapalika kula chokapi chela mu chilebhi chenihechi.<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />“Ngati mundu jokapi anakuliki nyambiku jihuhu panga kumanya, impalika abhohaje malepu gha nyambiku heji kwaka mpenganyambiku na kujonjukela pandu pa kahanu pa malepu gha nyambiku jeniheji. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Bhapenganyambiku ngacheibhapalika kujihakaha nyambiku jihuhu jebhabhoha bhandu bha Izilaeli kwaka Bambo Chapanga, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />kwa kubhajetakela kula nyambiku jihuhu heji, na bhela kubhaletela mahakau gha kubhapalika malepu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga nenuntenda kubha bhahuhu.”<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />Umpwaghila Haluni na bhana bhaki bhapenganyambiku anana: Ngati jumu winu, joabhi Muizilaeli au ngeni joatama mu inchi ja Izilaeli, anabhoha nyambiku jaki, jikubhi ja kubhoha nazili, au ja kupala mweni ja kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga kwa kujochakeka, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />impalika mboha chinyama chikambaku changakubha na chilema ikubhi ng'ombi, imbuhi au limbeleli nahuli chiweza kujetakalewa kwa ndandi jaki. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Ngawibhoha chindu chokapi chela chechibhi na chilema ng'o, kwa ndandi ngachijetakalewi kwa ndandi jaku. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Mundu jokapi paambokeha Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwali nahuli kubhoha nazili au nyambiku ja kupala mweni kuhuma mu lipogha laki la hinyama, nahuli ajetakaliwaje, chipalika chibya chinyama chikamilifu, chinyama hechi ngachikubha na chilema chokapi chela. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Ngawambokeha Bambo Chapanga chinyama chechibhi ngalola ng'o, au chechipotakiki wala chechibhi na chilema, au chokapi chela chechibhi na uhimba, au chechibhi na hikwanda au hilonda yeipiha uhila. Chokapi cha ntundu ghonihoghu ngachibhekakeka panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kujochakeka ng'o, nahuli kubha nyambiku jejibhohakike kwaka Bambo Chapanga ja kujochakeka kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Nambu uweza kupala na kubhoha nyambiku ja kupala wamweti, ng'ombi au limbeleli lelibhi na chilema au leliyakatali, nambu jeniheji ngajijetakalewi nahuli kubha nyambiku ja kubhoha nazili. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Ngawambokeha Bambo Chapanga chinyama ambachu chiungu chaki cha chikambaku chitehi kupotakeka, au chihekitwi ntondola, au chipekiwi libhanga, au chitehi kuheketwa. Ngamwihenga bhenibhela mu inchi jinu mabheti ng'o.<verse eid="LEV 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />Wala ngawijopa kuhuma kwaka ngeni hinyama ya ntundu ghonihoghu na kumokeha nepani Chapanga waku kubha chilebhi. Hinyama yeniheyi ngayijetakalewi kwa ndandi jaku, maghambu ibhi na chilema.<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Chikahi litoli likambaku la ng'ombi au mwanalimbeleli au mwanambuhi paibhelakeka, anaihighalya na nyongolu waki kwa machobha saba. Kutumbula lichobha la nane na kujendelela aweza kujetakelewa kubha nyambiku jejibhowakiki kwa Bambo Chapanga kwa kujochakeka kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Nambu ngawajichinja ng'ombi na litoli lake, au limbeleli na mwana waki, yokapi ibheli mu lichobha limu. <verse eid="LEV 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />Chikahi paumbohakela Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ja kunchengula, ujibhohaje kwa ntundu ghoupalika, nahuli jipata kujetakalewa kwa ndandi jaku. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Inyama ja chinyama hechi ipalika jikulakikaje mu lichobha lelalela, ngamwihighakila mbaka chilabhu jaki lukela. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />“Nkamulaje malaghalakilu ghangu na kughajengalela. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Ngamwalijeghe uhakau lihina langu lihuhu. Nambu ipalika mbata utopelu pachilanda ja bhandu bha Izilaeli. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga nenuntenda kubha bhahuhu, <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />na nenumbohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misli, nahuli ngubha Chapanga winu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu ghoubhekakiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli anana: Ayeyi nde uwangalalu yangu nepani Bambo Chapanga ambayu itehi kupangakika anamkubha na uhimanganu uhuhu. Uwangalalu yeipangakiki nde ayeye: <verse eid="LEV 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />Kubhi na machobha sita ghamuweza kuhenga mahengu, nambu lichobha la saba nde Sabato ja kupomulela, lichobha la uhimanganu uhuhu. Ngamwihenga lihengu lokapi lela, pandu pokapi pala pamtama, jeniheji nde Sabato kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />Uwangalalu yengi yangu nepani Bambo Chapanga nde ayeye, ambayu anamkubha na mihimanganu mihuhu mu chikahi chenihechi chechibhekakiki.<verse eid="LEV 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu wa Pasaka na Mabumunda Ghangakujegheleka Amila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Hesabu 28:16-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />“Pasaka jaka Bambo Chapanga jitumbula pakamihe ja lichobha la komi na ncheche la mwehi wa kutumbula. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Lichobha la komi na nhwanu la mwehi ghonihoghu wa kutumbula Uwangalalu waka Bambo Chapanga wa Mabumunda Ghangakujeghaleka Amila jitumbula, na kwa chikahi cha machobha saba anamkula mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Mu lichobha la kutumbula la kula mabumunda ghanihagha anamkubha na uhimanganu uhuhu, na mu lichobha leniheli ngamwihenga mahengu ghinu gha kila lichobha. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Kwa machobha saba anamundetila Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto. Mu lichobha heli la saba anantenda uhimanganu uhuhu, na ngamwihenga mahengu ghinu gha kila lichobha.”<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli anana: Chikahi pamwijingalaje mu inchi jenampekyaje na kuhuna mahunu gha inchi jeniheji, ndetaje kwaka mpenganyambiku lipukutu la mahunu gha kutumbula. <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />Mpenganyambiku anaahenga nalu lipukutu heli nginyulila ja kumokeha nepani mu lichobha la kabheli baada ja Sabato, nahuli mpata kujetakalewa. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Lichobha leniheli pamwikubha mtenda nginyulila ja kukweha lipukutu leniheli, impalika mmokiha nepani Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ja kujochakeka jaka mwanalimbeleli likambaku la chaka chimu langakubha na chilema. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Papamu na nyambiku jeniheji, mwibhoha nhupu ja uhembe wa mahunu kilu ibheli ya uhembi laini ghouhangaghinwi na mahuta gha zeituni, mwimokiha nepani Bambo Chapanga kwa moto, na kunungila kwaki anakunyambiha nepani. Nyambiku jaki ja chakunywa anajikubha nde lita jimu ja divai. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Mangani ja lichobha leniheli la kunete nepani Chapanga winu nyambiku jeniheji, ngamwikula mahunu ghinu gha kutumbula ng'o, ghakubhi mabhehi, au ghaghakalingwi, au ghaghajochakiki kubha mabumunda. Aleli analikubha lilaghalakilu la kutamakila kwa ibheleku yokapi yeihika, pandu pokapi pamwitamaje.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu wa Majuma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Hesabu 28:26-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />“Mwibhalanga majuma saba kamili kutumbu lichobha lela lelijengalela baada ja Sabato, lichobha lela lemwileta lipukutu la nyambiku ja kumokeha kwa nginyulila nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Mu lichobha la hamsini, lichobha la kabheli lelijengalela baada ja Sabato ja saba, mwimokiha nepani Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ja uhembi wahenu. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Kuhuma pandu pokapi pamwitamaje, mwileta mabumunda ghabheli gha nyambiku ja kubhoha kwa nginyulila palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. Kila libumunda ipalika lilenganakikaje kwa kilu ibheli ya uhembi laini ghoujeghaliki amila, na libumunda leniheli mwimokiha nepani Bambo Chapanga kubha nde nhupu ya malimbuku ghinu. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Papamu na ghanihagha, mwibhoha bhanambeleli saba bha chaka chimu, likambaku la ng'ombi limu, na mambeleli makambaku ghabheli, yangakubha na chilema. Hinyama yeniheyi anaikubha nyambiku ja kujochakeka papamu na nyambiku ya mahunu na nyambiku ya chakunywa. Kunungila kwa nyambiku yeniheyi anakunyambiha nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Bhelabhela mwibhoha nyambiku ja lipongu limu la imbuhi kwa ndandi ja kubhoha mahoku, na bhanambeleli bhabheli bha chaka chimu, kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kutama kwa lukwale. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Mpenganyambiku akwehaje bhanambeleli bhabheli habha palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga kubha nyambiku ja kujinuliwa, papamu na libumunda la mahunu gha kutumbula. Jeniheji nde nyambiku jihuhu kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, nayombi anaikubha kwa ndandi jaka mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Mu lichobha leleli mwitangaza uhimanganu uhuhu, na ngamwihenga mahengu ghinu gha kila lichobha. Aleli analikubha lilaghalakilu la mileli kwa ibheleku yokapi yeihika, pandu pokapi pamwitamaje.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />“Pauhuna mahunu gha mungonda, ngawihuna nakanopi mbaka mu malindakanilu gha mungonda waku ng'o, wala ngawikelabhuka kunyuma kubhongana mahighalilu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu wa Chaka Chahenu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 29:1-6">Hesabu 29:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />“Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli anana: Mu lichobha la kutumbula la mwehi wa saba anamkubha na lichobha la kupomulela, lipomulelu lihuhu la ukombukelu lelitangazwaje kwa kulapu mbata. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Ngamwihenga mahengu ghinu ghokapi ghala gha kila lichobha, nambu mbohaje nyambiku jejijochakiki kwa moto kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lichobha la Ujonganesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Hesabu 29:7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />“Lichobha la komi la mwehi hoghu wa saba nde lichobha la ujonganesu. Lichobha leniheli mwihenga uhimanganu uhuhu, mkonga kula, nanamu mboha nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Ngamwihenga lihengu lokapi lela mu lichobha leniheli, maghambu nde lichobha la ujonganesu ghouhengakeka kwa ndandi jinu palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Mundu jokapi jola jwangakukonga kula mu lichobha leniheli, impalika atengakika kutali la bhandu bhake. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Mundu jokapi jola joanahenga lihengu mu lichobha leniheli, ananunjonangaje abhoka pachilanda ja bhandu bhake. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Ngamwihenga lihengu la ntundu wokapi ghola ng'o. Aleli analikubha lilaghalakilu la mileli kwa ibheleku yokapi yeihika, pandu pokapi pamwitamaje. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Lichobha leniheli, kwinu analikubha nde Sabato ja kupomulela na kukonga kula. Lichobha la Sabato nde kutumbu pakamihi ja lichobha la tisa la mwehi ghonihoghu, mbaka pakamihi ja lichobha lelijengalela.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu wa Indamba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 29:12-40">Hesabu 29:12-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli anana: Mu lichobha la komi na nhwanu la mwehi wa saba nde uwangalalu wa indamba ja kuntopela Bambo Chapanga, kwa chikahi cha machobha saba. Ghonihoghu nde uwangalalu waka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Lichobha la kutumbula la machobha saba hagha, mwikubhaje na uhimanganu uhuhu wa kujojabhela, ngamwihenga mahengu ghinu gha kila lichobha. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Kwa machobha saba mwibhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Mu lichobha la nane anamkubha na uhimanganu ukolongwa na kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ja kujochakeka. Uhimanganu ghonihoghu nde uhuhu, na ngamwihenga mahengu ghinu gha kila lichobha.<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />Ayeyi nde uwangalalu yaka Bambo Chapanga yeiamuliwi, ambayu anamwitangaza kubha mihimanganu mihuhu kwa kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga nyambiku yeibhohakeka kwa moto, nyambiku ya kujochakeka, nyambiku ya mahunu na nyambiku ya chakunywa, kila nyambiku mu lichobha laki. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Nyambiku yeniheyi nde papamu na yela yemmokeha nepani Bambo Chapanga mu lichobha la Sabato ngati bhela nyambiku hinu ya kila lichobha, nyambiku ya kutimiza nazili hinu, na nyambiku hinu ya kupala mabhete yemmokeha nepani Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />Ananjomwi kuhuna mighonda jinu, mwihenga uwangalalu waka Bambo Chapanga kwa chikahi cha machobha saba, kutumbu lichobha la komi na nhwanu la mwehi wa saba. Lichobha la kutumbula la machobha ghanihagha nde lichobha la kupomulela, bhelabhela na lichobha la nane nde lichobha la kupomulela. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Mu lichobha la kutumbula mwitola mapambiku manyahi gha mikongu jinu, mambandi gha mitende, mambandi ghaghabhi na mahamba ghamaheli, na mambandi gha mikongu jejimela munkeghi ja nkoka, nanamu mwihenga uwangalalu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa machobha saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Kila chaka impalika kutenda uwangalalu aghoghu kwa chikahi cha machobha saba kwa ndandi ja kuntopela Bambo Chapanga. Aleli analikubha lilaghalakilu la mileli kwa ibheleku hinu yokapi yeihika. Mtendaje uwangalalu hoghu mu mwehi wa saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Mwitamaje mu indamba kwa machobha saba. Bhabhelakeka bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhitamaje mu indamba, <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />nahuli bhabhelakeka bhinu bhamanyaje kubha nakabhatendiki Bhaizilaeli bhatamaje mu indamba chikahi panakabhabhohiki kuhuma mu inchi ja Misili. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Bhela Musa akabhatangazi Bhaizilaeli uwangalalu yeibhekakiki na Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu gha kujighoha taa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 27:20-21">Kubhoka 27:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“Ubhalaghalakya Bhaizilaeli bhakuletila mahuta manyahi gha zeituni jinyahi ghaghaminyakiki wichu kwa ndandi ja taa jela, nahuli taa heji jibhelalaje chikahi chokapi. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Haluni anaajibheka taa heji mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu, kunja ja lipazia la lisanduku la ulandilu, nahuli jipata kubhelela palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kutumbu pakamihi mbaka lukela. Aleli nde lilaghilu la mileli kwa ibheleku yokapi yeihika. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Haluni abhekaje taa heyi panani ja chinala cha taa cha zaabu jinyahi, na ipalika ibhelalaje chikahi chokapi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabumunda ghaghabhohakeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />“Utolaje uhembi laini kilu komi na ibheli, na ujochaje mabumunda komi na ghabheli. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Mabumunda ghanihagha ughapangaje misitali jibheli panani ja meza ja zaabu jinyahi, kila msitali ubheka mabumunda sita palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Kila panani ja msitali ujeghala ubani unyahi nahuli ukamulana na mabumunda ghanihagha, na kubha pandu pa nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto ja kombukombu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Kila lichobha la Sabato mabumunda ghanihagha ghabhekakikaje kwa kulengana palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, kwa ndandi ja bhandu bha Izilaeli, kubha lulaghilu lwa mileli. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Haluni na bhana bhaki pela nde bhabhapalika kula mabumunda ghanihagha, maghambu nde pandu pahuhu namaa pa lifungu labhu la nyambiku jejibhohakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa moto, kwa amuli ja mileli.”<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utemulu ghoupalika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Bhela lichobha limu kukapitali kukomana kulikambi hoku pachilanda jaka Muizilaeli jumu na nkombu jumu waka mabhu Muizilaeli joakalowakiki Shelomisi, nambu tati waki akabhi Mmisili. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Nkombu waka mabhu Muizilaeli hoju akalilongimi lihina laka Bambo Chapanga kwa kulipeke masolu, bhela bhandu bhakumpeliki nkombu hoju kwaka Musa. Lihina laka mabhu waki akalowakiki Shelomisi, mwali waka Dabili, wa likabila laka Dani. <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />Nabhombi bhakumbekiki mu chifungu, mbaka mapalu ghaka Bambo Chapanga ghayekuliwa kwabhu.<verse eid="LEV 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa: <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Untola nkombu joakalongimi hoju mbaka kunja ja likambi, na bhandu bhokapi bhabhakunjowini chikahi paakabhi alonge ghanihagha bhabheka mabhoku ghabhu panani ja mmutu waki, na panihapa uhimanganu wokapi bhundapula kwa maganga. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli: ‘Anangati mundu jokapi jola anaampeki masolu Chapanga waki, anaatemuliwaje kwa lihoku laki. <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />Mundu jokapi jola anaabhi mwenehi au ngeni joantondola Bambo Chapanga, uhimanganu wokapi anabhunkoma kwa kundapu maganga.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />“Mundu jokapi jola joankoma njaki, najombi ipalika akomakikaje. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Mundu jokapi jola joakoma chinyama chaka njaki, apalika alepaje, apalika alepaje chinyama ngati chela chela.<verse eid="LEV 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />“Mundu jokapi joampoteka njaki, ipalika najombi apotakika bhelabhela kulengana na moampotaki njaki. <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />Ngati anaantunywi chihupa, najombi anaatunyuliwa chihupa, lihu kwa lihu, linu kwa linu. Ngati moampotaki njaki, najombi anaapotakika bhelabhela. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Mundu jokapi joakoma chinyama chaka njaki apalika alepaje, nambu mundu jokapi jola anaankomiki njaki, ipalika najombi akomakikaje. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Shelia ajeji anajihenga lihengu kwaka ngeni na mwenehi, maghambu nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Bhela, Musa akalongi na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, nabhombi bhakuntoliki nkombu joakumpeki masolu Chapanga jola mbaka kunja ja likambi, na kundapula kwa maganga. Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s">Chaka cha Saba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 15:1-11">Kombukombu la Tolati 15:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa pa chitombi cha Sinai, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />“Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli, ‘Pamwijingilaje mu nchi jeananumpekeya mwanganya, inchi jeni jipalika jighonalyaje ngati Sabato kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Ndemaje mighonda jinu kwa hyaka sita, mpandaji, nkulaghalyaji mizabibu jinu na kuhuna mahunu ghinu. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Nambu chaka cha saba ipalika inchi jikubha na Sabato ja kupomulela, nde Sabato kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Ngamwipanda imbeju mu mighonda jinu, wala ngamwiheketa mambandi gha mizabibu jinu. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Ngamwihuna wala kubheka akiba chokapi chela chekimeliki cheni, wala kuhuna na kusindika zabibu ambayu mwehapa ngachemwakulaghali mighonda jaki. Inchi jipalika jikubha na chaka cha kupomulela. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Chokapi chela chechimela cheni mu chaka cha Sabato anachikubha chilebhi chinu mabheti, bhatumika bhinu bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, bhatumika bhamubhaajili, na bhagheni bhabhatama pachilanda jinu. <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />Bhelabhela inchi anajileha hinyama hinu ya kudimakika na hinyama ya muchitengu. Chindu chokapi chechimelaje mu inchi chiweza kuleleka.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chaka cha Jubilii, yani hyaka hamsini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />Mwibhalanga hyaka saba ya Sabato, yani hyaka saba mala saba, anampata hyaka saba ya Sabato kwinu, na jumula jaki nde hyaka alobaini na tisa. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Bhela, mu lichobha la komi la mwehi wa saba, ambalu nde Lichobha la Ujonganesu muntuma mundu kulapu lipenga mu inchi jokapi. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Chaka cha hamsini ipalika mchitopilaje kwa kutangaza kulijeka kwa bhatumwa bhokapi mu inchi. Chaka chenihechi anachikubha chaka cha Jubilii kwinu. Kila jumu winu anaimpalika kukelabhuka kwa bhandu bha lukolu lwaki. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Chaka chenihechi cha hamsini anachikubha Jubilii kwinu, ngamwipanda wala ngamwihuna chokapi chela chekimeliki cheni, wala ngamwihuna zabibu ambayu ngachemwikulaghalile. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Kwa kubha chaka chenihechi nde Jubilii kwinu, bhela anachikubha chaka chihuhu kwinu. Henu mwikula chela chekimela cheni mungonda.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />Mu chaka chenihechi cha Jubilii, kila chindu chechahemaliwi chipalika mchikelabhuha kwaka mweni chaki.<verse eid="LEV 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Bhela ngati anaundombasi njaku chokapi chela, au anauhemili chokapi chela kuhuma kwaka njaku, ngawamponja. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Uhemala ngonda kuhuma kwa mwenehi kulengana na ubhalangiku wa hyaka baada ja Jubilii. Najombi alombisa kwaku kulengana na ubhalangiku wa hyaka yeihighalile ya kuhuna mahunu. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Hyaka anaibhi yamaheli, ujonjukya bei, na hyaka inaibhi ichoku, uheliya bei, maghambu chela cheakulombasela chakaka nde mahunu ghaghaweza kuhunakika monihomu. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Ngamwiponjana, nambu munjoghupa Chapanga winu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litatizu la chaka cha saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />Bhela, njengalya amuli yangu, na kughakamu malaghalakilu ghangu, nahuli mpata kutama kwa lukwale mu inchi. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Bhela inchi anajipiha mahunu ghaki nanamu anamkula na kutupila monihomu kwa lukwale.<verse eid="LEV 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />“Muweza kulalukila, ‘Bho, anatukula kike mu chaka cha saba, ngati ngacheitupalika kupanda mahunu wala kuhuna mahunu ghito?’ ” <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Nepani Bambo Chapanga ananumpengalya mu chaka cha sita, nahuli mighonda jinu jipiha mahunu gha kunjaghanila kwa hyaka itatu nakanope. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Chikahi pamwipanda mu chaka cha nane, anamkula mahunu gha mwandi na ananjendalya pe kula hata mu chaka cha tisa pamwihuna mahunu ghinu.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />Ngonda waku ngawilombesa kwa mkataba wa kutamakila ng'o, maghambu mighonda nde mali ghango, na mabhanganya nde bhagheni na mwempeta mu inchi jango.<verse eid="LEV 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukelabhuha mighonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Pandu pokapi pala pa inchi pamwikamula kubha pinu, impalika mkubhaje na ntetu wa kujikombo inchi. <verse eid="LEV 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />Anakubhi jumu wa bhabhelakeka bha inchi jaku abhi kahochu na anaalombisi mali ghaki ghakumu, bhela, ndongu waki wa pambipi anaimpalika kukombola chela chealombisi ndongu waki. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Anangati mundu jonihoju ngacheabhi na ndongu wa pambipi wa kuweza kukombola mali ghanihagha kwa ndandi jaki, nambu anaakangami mweni na kuweza kughakombola, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />bhela, abhalanga kabhete samani jaki kutumbu paakalombisi, na kulepa chela chechihighalile cha samani jaka mundu jola joakabhi andombasi mali ghanihagha, najombi anaaweza kukelabhuha kwaki. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Nambu ngati ngacheabhi na uwezu wa kujikombola, bhela mali ghala ghaalombisi anaghajendalya kubha ghaka jola joahemile mbaka chaka cha uwangalalu wa Jubilii. Mali ghanihagha anaghalekakiwa mu chaka cha Jubilii, na kujendalela kubha ghaka jola joakalombise.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />Ngati mundu anaalombisi nyumba jejibhi mkati ja muchi ghouyongalitwi na lumatu, jombi aweza kujikombola mu chaka chimu kutumbu paakalombisi nyumba jeniheji. Kwa chaka chenihechi chokapi aweza kujikombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Ngati nyumba jeniheji ngachejikombuliwi mu chaka chimu hechi, bhela, nyumba jeniheji jejibhi mkati ja muchi ghoubhi na lumatu, anajijendalya kubha jaka mundu jola joahemili mileli kwa ibhelelu yaki yokapi. Ngaipaliki kujikelabhuha mu chaka cha uwangalalu wa Jubilii. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Nambu nyumba yeibhi kwijiji, yangakuyongalotwa na lumatu anaibhalangika ngati mighonda. Yeniheyi iweza kukombulewa, na iweza kulekakewa mu chaka cha Jubilii. <verse eid="LEV 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Hata bhela, nyumba yeibhi mu michi ja Bhalawi, iweza kukombulewa mu chikahi chokapi chela. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Bhela mali gha Bhalawi ghaweza kukombulewa, yani nyumba jejihemaliwi mu muchi wokapi ghola ghobhatama, ghalekakiwaje mu chaka cha Jubilii, maghambu nyumba yeibhi mu michi ja Bhalawi nde pandu pabhu kuhuma kwa bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Nambu pandu pa kulekeha hinyama yabhu pabhatama Bhalawi ngapihemalewa, ndandi panihapa nde upwelelu wabhu mileli.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhajahika akakahochu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />Ngati njaku anaabhi kahochu, hata anaalepali kulighoha mweni pachilanda jaku, ikupalika unjangatyaje nahuli ajendalya kutama, untendila ngati ngeni au mpeta indela joabhi kwaku. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Ngawanjopa akulepa liba jokapi jela, nambu unjoghupa Chapanga waku, nahuli njaku najombi ajendalya kutama pachilanda jaku. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Ngawanjahika mbija nahuli alepa na liba, wala ngawanjahika chilebhi nahuli alepa na liba. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nenukuletiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili nahuli nukupekya inchi ja Kanaani, na nepani mbata kubha Chapanga waku.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhalekakela kulijeka kwa bhatumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />“Ngati njaku joatama pambipi na wehapa anaabhi kahochu, anaalilombisi kwaku, ngawantenda akutumakya ngati mtumwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Kwaku wehapa anaakubha ngati muhengalihengu waku au ngati mpeta indela. Jonihoju anaatumika mbaka chaka cha Jubilii. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Panihapa jombi na bhana bhaki anabhalekakiwaje, najombi anaakelabhuka kwa bhandu bha lukolu lwaki, na koghabhi mali gha akatati bhaki. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Maghambu Bhaizilaeli nde bhatumika bhangu bhanabhaletiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili, bhela, ngabhihemalewa ngati bhatumwa ng'o. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Ngaubhatendela bhajaku kwa makili, nambu unjoghupa Chapanga waku. <verse eid="LEV 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />Ngati anaupala kubha na bhatumwa, bha chimbomba au bha chikambaku, ubhahemala kuhuma ku inchi yengi yeyukuyongalota. Kuhuma kwabhu uweza kubhaheme bhatumwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Bhelabhela uweza kubhaheme bhatumwa kuhuma kwa bhagheni bhabhatama papamu na wehapa, na bhalongu bhabhu bhabhabhelakiki mu inchi jinu, nabhombi anabhakubha mali ghaku. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Bhatumwa bhanihabha uweza kubhapekeha bhana bhaku kubha mali ghabhu mileli. Bhanihabha uweza kubhatenda kubha bhatumwa bhaku, nambu bhalongu Bhaizilaeli bhajaku, ngaubhatendela kwa makili.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />“Ngati ngeni au mpeta indela joatama pachilanda jaku anaabhi na hindu yamaheli, na Muizilaeli njaku anaabhi kahochu, na kulilombesa kwaka ngeni hoju au kwaka mpeta indela au kwa bhalongu bhabhu bha ngolu ya chigheni, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />anaajomwi kuhemalewa aweza kukombulewa, mundu jumu pachilanda ja bhalongu bhaki aweza kunkombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Nijaja waki au binamu waki, au jokapi jola joabhi ndongu wa mwahi mu lukolu lwaki aweza kunkombola. Au anangati mweni abhi na hindu yamaheli, aweza kulikombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Jombi papamu na joanhemi hoju, bhabhalanga hyaka kutumbu paakalilombisi kwaka mundu hoju mbaka chaka cha Jubilii. Samani ja kulekakewa kwaki anajilengana na ubhalangiku wa hyaka yeatumike. Chikahi cheabhi mtumwa waka bambo waki anachitumika ngati chikahi chaka mtumika wa kuajiliwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Ngati anaihighali hyaka yamaheli kuhika mu chaka cha Jubilii, anaimpalika kulepa pakolongwa nakanopi, kubhokana na bei jejakatumiki kunhemela. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Ngati hyaka yeihighalili nde ichokopi kuhika mu chaka cha Jubilii, anaahenga ubhalangiku waki, najombi anaalepa malepu ghaghapalika kwa ndandi ja kukombulewa kwaki. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Chikahi chokapi paanakubha kwaka bambo waki, ipalika ahengiwaje ngati mtumika joajiliwe kila chaka. Mundu hoju joanhemili ngaantawala kwa makili. <verse eid="LEV 25:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Nambu anangati mundu jonihoju au bhalongu bhaki ngachebhakombuliwi kwa indela jeniheji, bhela jombi papamu na bhana bhaki bhapalika bhalekakiwaje mu chaka cha Jubilii. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Kwa kubha Bhaizilaeli nde bhatumika. Bhombi nde bhatumika bhangu bhanakabhohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s">Mbengalelu kwa bhabhatii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Kombukombu la Tolati 7:12-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />“Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, ‘Ngamwalinganakela imong'umong'u ya ichapanga ya ntundu wokapi ghola, ngamwikamu imong'umong'u yabhu ya kubhacha wala nguzu, wala imong'umong'u ya maganga yeibhachakiki mu inchi jinu na kuijojabhela. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Nkamula Sabato yangu na kupatopela pandu pangu pahuhu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />“Ngati ananjengalili amuli yangu, na kughakamula malaghalakilu ghangu, na kuitenda, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />ananuntonyila iyula kwa chikahi chechipalika, na luhombi analupiha mahunu, na mikongu ja mumighonda anajipiha mapambiku ghaki. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Kupumunda ilebhi anakujendalya mbaka chikahi cha kuhuna zabibu, na kuhuna zabibu anakujendalya mbaka chikahi cha kupanda imbeju. Nanamu anamkubha na chilebhi chamaheli, anamkula na kutupila, na kutama kwa lukwali mu inchi jinu.<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />“Ananumpekya lukwali mu inchi, nanamu anamghonila panga kujeghaleka choghohi na chindu chokapi chela. Ananibhoha hinyama ikali ibhoka mu inchi jinu, na ngakwikubhi na ngondo nakanopi mu inchi jinu. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Anamubhatopula maadui bhinu, na kubhakoma kwa lipanga. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Bhandu nhwanu bha kwinu anabhabhatopula maadui mia jimu, na bhandu mia jimu bha kwinu anabhabhatopula maadui elufu komi. Nabhombi maadui bhinu anabhayonangika palongi jinu kwa lipanga. <verse eid="LEV 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Ananumpengalyaji na kunjangatila mpata bhana bhamaheli, na kunjonjukela, nanatu anangamulakya lulaghilu lwangu na mwehapa. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Chikahi cha mahunu anamkubha mwakali nkula mahunu gha mwande, na anaimpalika kughabhoha mahunu gha mwande, nahuli mpata mbekenyu ja kughabheka mahunu ghahenu. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Nepani andama pachilanda jinu, wala nepani ngananhakalile. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Ananyenda pachilanda jinu, na kubha Chapanga winu, nanamu anamkubha mabhandu bhangu. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nenumbohiki ku inchi ja Misili, nahuli ngamwijendale kubha bhatumwa bha Bhamisili. Nepani ndunywili chingolingoli chemwakongakiki mwehapa pahingu hinu, na kuntenda njenda koni mimutu jinu njinwi kunani.<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utemulu kwa bhangakutii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Kombukombu la Tolati 28:15-68</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />“Nambu ngati ngamwijowaneli na kughatenda malaghalakilu ghangu ghokapi, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />nanamu ngati anamkaniki amuli yangu, na roho hinu anaihakalili shelia yangu, na kulepalela kughatenda malaghalakilu ghangu ghokapi, na kuheketa lulaghilu lwangu, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />bhela nepani ananunhengila anana: Ananundetila panani jinu choghohi cha kupwitukila, itamu ya kujoghoha, kukomola na chitamu cheanachuntenda kubha akangalola na kumbokeha womi winu. Anampanda imbeju hinu panga kupata chokapi chela, ndandi adui bhinu nde bhaanabhakulaje. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Nepani ananundolakya kwa kunyomela, nahuli ndapulika palongi ja maadui bhinu. Bhala bhamubhahakalila anabhuntawalaje, nanamu anamtilaje hata ngati njeta mundu joantopola.<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />“Bhela ngati baada ja ghanihagha ghokapi ngamwinyowaneli, bhela, ananundapula mala saba nakanopi kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghinu. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Ananhekatya kutali ing'omu hinu kwa kuitenda mbengu kunani hoku kubha ya kunonopa ngati choma, na inchi jinu panga iyula na kubha jijomu ngati madini gha shaba. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Anamtumila makili ghinu pawaka, maghambu mighonda jinu ngajipihi mahunu ghaki, wala mikongu ja mu inchi jinu ngajipambiki mapambiku ghaki.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />“Ngati ananjendali kumbenga na kukana kunyowanela, ananyonjukya malapuliku ghinu mala saba nakanopi panani jinu, ngati mahoku ghinu moghabhelile. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Ananeta hinyama ikali pachilanda jinu, nahuli ikula bhana bhinu, na kuiyonanga hinyama hinu ya kudimakika, na kuntenda ubhalangiku winu ukepaje, hata indela hinu anaing'anambuka na kubha ngati lipololu.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />“Anakubhi papamu na mambu ghanihagha ghokapi ngamwikelabhuki kabheti kwangu nepani, nambu ananjendali kupengana na nepani, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />panihapa nepani anangubha adui winu, na kundapula mala saba nakanopi, kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghinu. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Ananundetila ngondo panani jinu, jeanajilepa kisasi kwa kuheketa lulaghilu lwangu. Chikahi pamwikubha mtilila mu michi jinu, nepani ananduma chitamu chihakau pachilanda jinu, na kuntenda ndepalyaje palongi ja maadui bhinu. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Chilebhi chinu ananichitenda chikepaje, hata akambomba komi anabhatumila lijiku limu kuteleka mabumunda. Anabhungabhila kwa chipemu. Anamkulaji nambu ngamwitupile.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />“Kabhete ngati baada ja ghanihagha ghokapi ngamwipali kunyowanela, nambu ananjendalili kubgana nepani, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />bhela nepani anambengana na mwehapa kwa inyela jikali, na ananundapula mala saba nakanopi kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghinu. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Panihapa anamkula inyama ya bhana bhinu bha chikambaku, na bhana bhinu bha chimbomba. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Ananapayonanga pandu pinu panani pa kujojabhela, anamombula pandu pinu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kuhuwa ubani, na kujilekela mituhi jinu panani ja imong'umong'u ya ichapanga hinu, na nepani ananunhakalya mwehapa nakanopi. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Ananijitenda michi jinu kubha mahame, na kupayonanga pandu pahuhu pinu pa kujojabhela, nanatu nganinyambakiki na kunungila kwa nyambiku hinu. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Ananiyonangaje michi jinu na kubha ukebha, nahuli adui bhinu bhabhihika kutama monihomu bhakangachaje. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Ananuntenda mwehapa mpechanganaje kwa bhandu bha inchi nayenge, na kuholapola lipanga langu na kunjengalela. Inchi jinu anajikubha ukebha, na michi jinu anajikubha mahame. <verse eid="LEV 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Chikahi mwehapa pamwikubha mtolakiki kwa makili kujenda ku inchi ya maadui bhinu, panihapa nde inchi anajihekalya Sabato yaki, chikahi pajikubha jibhi ukebha. Bhela inchi anajipomulyaje, na kuhekalela Sabato yaki. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Chikahi chokapi inchi pajikubha ukebha, anajipomulyaji na kuhekalela Sabato yaki, ambayu ngachejakabhi jipata chikahi mwehapa pamukabhi mtama monihomu.<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />“Bhandu bhala bhabhihighalyaje pachilanda jinu, ananijitenda mitima jabhu kubha na choghohi chikolongwa mu inchi ya maadui bhabhu, hata sauti ja lihamba lelipuluta analabhatenda bhatilaje. Anabhatila na kuhabhuka ngati mundu atila lipanga, hata ngati njeta mundu joabhatopola. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Anabhahabhukanyaje bheni kwa bheni ngati bhatila lipanga, hata ngati njeta mundu joabhajengalela. Bhela ngamwikubhi na makili gha kukomana na maadui bhinu. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Anamuyonangikaje pachilanda ja bhandu bha inchi nayenge, na inchi ya maadui bhinu anayumilaje. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Ngati bhakumu bhinu anabhahighalili mu inchi ya maadui bhinu, anabhayonangikaje kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghabhu, na kwa ndandi ja mahoku gha akahoko bhabhu.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />“Nambu ngati bhabhelakeka bhinu anabhang'anambwiki na kughaleka mahoku ghabhu na mahoku gha akahoku bhabhu, panani ja kungana nepani, na panani ja kumbenga kwabhu nepani, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />anabhamanyi ndandi jangu nepani kupengana nabhu, na kubhapeleka ku inchi ya maadui bhabhu, chikahi mitima jabhu jejinonwipi pajalihelihaje na kung'anambuka na kughaleka mahoku ghabhu, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />bhela, nepani anangombuka lulaghilu lwangu lonakatendiki na Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo, na kujikomboka inchi jela jenakabhalaghile. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Kwa kubha anabhajileka inchi ukebha, inchi jeniheji anajihekalya Sabato yaki chikahi pajikubha jibhi mu hali ja ukebha. Chikahi chenihechi bhombi anabhalapulikaje, maghambu bhakaikaniki shelia yangu na kuihakalila amuli yangu. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Nambu papamu na lendenu, chikahi pabhikubha mu inchi ya maadui bhabhu, nganabhakani wala kubhahakalila kihengu cha kubhayonanga nakanopi, na kuheketa lulaghilu lwangu na bhombi. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wabhu. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Nambu kwa ndandi jabhu ananulukombuka lulaghilu lwangu lonakahengiki na akahoko bhabhu, ambabhu nakabhabhohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili, palongi ja bhandu bha inchi najengi, nahuli nepani ngubha Chapanga wabhu. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Yeniheyi nde amuli, shelia na malaghalakilu Bambo Chapanga ghaakahengiki pachilanda jaki na bhandu bha Izilaeli panani ja chitombi cha Sinai kwa kupetela Musa.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s">Shelia panani ja nhupu yaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />“Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli anana, ‘Ngati mundu jokapi jola anaabhekiki nazili ja kumboha mundu kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga, mundu jonihoju aweza kujibhoha nazili jaki kwa kulepa mbija ngati moipangakike. <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />Mwanalomi wa hyaka ishilini mbaka sitini anaakombuliwa kwa ipandi hamsini ya madini gha feza, kulengana na chipemu chechibhekakiki mu pandu pahuhu. <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />Ngati nde mbomba, anaakombuliwa kwa ipandi selasini ya madini gha feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Ngati mundu jonihoju nde wa hyaka nhwanu mbaka ishilini, anaakombuliwa kwa ipandi ishilini ya madini gha feza kwaka mwanaloni, na ipandi komi ya madini gha feza ngati nde mbomba. <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Ngati mundu jonihoju nde wa mwehi ghumu mbaka hyaka nhwanu, anaakombuliwa kwa ipandi nhwanu ya madini gha feza ngati nde mwanalomi, na ipandi itatu ya madini gha feza ngati nde mbomba. <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Ngati mundu jonihoju anaabhi na hyaka sitini na kujendalela, anaakombuliwa kwa ipandi komi na nhwanu ya madini gha feza ngati nde mwanalomi, na ipandi komi ya madini gha feza ngati nde mbomba.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />Nambu anangati mundu joabhekiki nazili hoju nde kahochu nakanopi, na kubha ngacheaweza kulepa pandu panihapa pa madini gha feza, ampelaka mundu hoju kwaka mpenganyambiku. Najombi mpenganyambiku anaapemaje samani jaka mundu hoju, kulengana na chela cheaweza kulepa mundu jola joabhekiki nazili.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />Ngati nazili jeni abhekiki chinyama cha ntundu ambau bhandu bhaweza kumbokeha nyambiku Bambo Chapanga, bhela chinyama chenihechi anachikubha chihuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Mundu ngacheapalika kuching'anambula chinyama chenihechi kwa chengi, chamboni kwa chihakau, au chihakau kwa chamboni. Ngati anaang'anambwili kwa chinyama chengi, hinyama yokapi ibheli anaikubha ihuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Ngati nazili jeniheji akabhekiki chinyama chihakau, cha ntundu ambau ngacheipalika kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga nyamabiku, bhela, mundu joabhohiki achiletaje chinyama hechi kwaka mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />Mpenganyambiku anaachipema chinyama hechi na kubhona unyahi au uhakau waki. Samani ambaju mpenganyambiku anaapwaghilaje, bhenibhela nde mokwibhelilaje. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Ngati mweni chinyama hechi anaapaliki kuchikombola chinyama chaki, bhela, impalika ajonjukyaje asilimia ishilini ja samani ja chinyama chenihechi.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />Mundu anaajibhekiki nyumba jaki kwa kujitenda kubha jaka Bambo Chapanga, mpenganyambiku anaapwaghaje samani ja nyumba jeniheji kulengana na unyahi au uhakau waki. Ngati mpenganyambiku moaipwaghilaje samani jaki, bhenibhela nde mokwibhelilaje. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Ngati mundu joajitengiki nyumba heji kubha jaka Chapanga anaapaliki kujikombola, bhela, anaimpalika kujonjukela asilimia ishilini ja samani ja nyumba heji, najombi anajikubha mali ghaki.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />“Mundu anaabhekiki pandu pa ngonda waki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, bhela, samani jaki anajipemakika kwa kulingalila imbeju yeitumika kupanda mu ngonda ghonihoghu. Kwa kila kilu ishilini ya shaili, samani ja ngonda ghonihoghu anaukubha ipandi hamsini ya madini gha feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Ngati anaabhekiki ngonda waki kwaka Bambo Chapanga mu chaka cha Jubilii, yani kombukombu ja hyaka hamsini, samani jaki anajipemakika bhelabhela kulengana na ipemu hinu. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Nambu ngati anaabhekiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga baada ja chaka chenihechi cha Jubilii, bhela, mpenganyambiku anaabheka samani jaki kulengana na hyaka yeihighalile mbaka kuhika mu chaka cha Jubilii chechihika, na samani jaki anajikepaje. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Ngati mweni ngonda ghonihoghu anaapaliki kuukombola, anaimpalika kujonjukela asilimia ishilini ja samani ja ngonda ghonihoghu, na ngonda hoghu anaukubha mali ghaki. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Nambu ngati ngacheapala kuukombola, au ngati anaandombasi mundu jongi ngonda ghonihoghu, bhela, ngacheiwezikana kuukombola ng'o. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Chaka cha Jubilii anachihikiki, ngonda ghonihoghu anaulekakiwaji na kubha uhuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Nawombi anaukubha mali ghaka mpenganyambiku.”<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />Ngati mundu anaabhekiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga ngonda ghoahemili, yani nde pandu pangakubha pa upwelelu waki, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />mpenganyambiku anaapwaghaje samani ja ngonda ghonihoghu kulengana na hyaka yeihighalile mbaka kuhika mu chaka cha Jubilii, na mundu jonihoju anaimpalika kulepa samani jaki mu lichobha leniheli, ngati nde chindu chihuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Nambu mu chaka cha Jubilii, ngonda ghonihoghu anaipalika akelabhukiwaje mundu jola joakalombise.<verse eid="LEV 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />Kila samani jipalika jipemakikaje kwa chipemu cha kutopa cha kupemela ipandi ya madini gha feza cha pandu pahuhu: Pambipi na lobu kilu ya madini gha feda ilengana na chipandi chimu cha madini gha feza.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />Nambu njeta mundu joanaimpalika kumbeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga mbelakeka waki wa kutumbula wa hinyama, jikubhi ng'ombi au imbuhi, maghambu yeniheyi tayali nde yaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Ngati chinyama hechi nde chihakau, mweni chinyama hechi anaachihemalaje kulengana na samani jaki, na kujonjukela asilimia ishilini ja samani jeniheji. Ngati chinyama hechi ngachikombulewi, bhela, anachihemaliwaje kulengana na ipemu ya pandu pahuhu.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />Nambu chindu chokapi chela chechibhekakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, akubhi nde mundu, au chinyama, au ngonda ghoupatakini kwa kupwelela, ngawihemalewi wala kukombulewa. Chokapi chela chechibhekakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, chenihechi nde chihuhu namaa kwaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="LEV 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Mundu jokapi jola joabhekakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga nahuli ayonangikaje, ngacheaweza kukombulewa. Mundu ngati jonihoju ipalika akomakikaje.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />Zaka ja mahunu au mapambiku gha mikongu, yokapi nde mali ghaka Bambo Chapanga, yeniheyi nde ihuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Ngati mundu anaapaliki kupakombola zaka jaki, anaimpalika kulepa samani jaki na kujonjukela asilimia ishilini ja samani ja zaka jaki. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Zaka kubhokana na hinyama yokapi kuhuma mu lipogha la ng'ombi, au mambeleli, na imbuhi, kila chinyama cha komi chechipeta pahi ja ndonga jaka jola joadima, anachikubha chihuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Mundu jokapi jola ngailalukila kubhokana na unyahi au uhakau wa chinyama chenihechi, wala chinyama chenihechi ngacheipalika kung'anambuliwa kwa chinyama chengi ng'o. Ngati anaching'anambuliwi kwa chinyama chengi, hinyama yokapi ibheli anaikubha ihuhu, na ngaiwezikani kuikombola.<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Yeniheyi nde amuli ambayu Bambo Chapanga akundaghalaki Musa nahuli abhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli panani ja chitombi cha Sinai.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>